<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">- Cishingini Agwara Kambari [asg]</book>
  <para style="h">NGONO</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ng</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ngono</para>
  <para style="toc1">Katagarda ko 2 Ngono</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ngono</para>
  <para style="is1">Kuɓa̱yuwa̱</para>
  <para style="ip">Katagarda ko ngono ke ire ka lyaꞋa ta̱ kelime n ukuna u tsugono ci Isaraila n tsa aza a Yahuda, a̱ ubuta̱ u na ngono m ugiti n da̱sa̱ngi. Katagarda ka nampa ki ta̱ upeci kure. (1) Kapashi ka nampa ki ta̱ e kuneke arabali o tsugono ci Isaraila n ci Yahuda a kubana a̱ya̱ amangatawunkunla̱i n amangere n kupa (850) kafu a matsa Yesu a kubana uyikpi u Samariya, n ukocishi u tsugono ci Isaraila n uɓon u gaɗi, a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka amangatawencindere (722) kafu a matsa Yesu, (2) Arabali o tsugono ci Yahuda ili i na i ɗikai ali a ayin a na tsugono tsa aza a Isaraila tsu yikpa̱i a kubana Urushelima ekiye e Nebukanezaru vuza va aza a Babila a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka amangatawantawun n amanga̱na̱shi n a̱ta̱li (586) kafu a matsa Yesu. Katagarda ka ko kotsusa̱ta̱ n arabali a Gedaliya vuzagbayin vu Yahuda wa aza a Babila, n arabali a̱ wuti u mogono Jehoyakimu na wi a Yahuda a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbashi a Babila.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ma̱dukpa̱ ma̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama a unambi wu usuɓi wu ngono, n uma a Isaraila n Yahuda. Wuni u Urushelima n uloki u uma a Yahuda wo okpoi usabaꞋi wa arabali aza a Isaraila. Ukpa̱ɗi wu usuɓi wa aza a na Ka̱shile ka zagbai n uyikpi u tsugono tsu le wi ta̱ o kokpo adanshi wi ta̱ a̱ kusa̱nka̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ kpa̱ɗa̱ kushatangu ukuna u wuma u ɗa̱. Ɗa Ka̱shile ka isai uma kenu aza a na a̱ tsu kpa̱ɗa̱ ku kuɗa̱ngu a̱ ka̱ma̱li ka Balu. Adama aza a usuɓi a na a buwai ɗaɗa u nekei Ka̱shile utsura wu uzuwakpani u na u yaꞋin n uma a̱ ni. I na katagarda ka ki a kudansa i na baci de dem uma a yaꞋin, i a kufuɗa kusa̱nka̱ Ka̱shile kushatangu i na u sheshei kuyaꞋanka uma a̱ ni ba, n suku ta̱ n kishi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na yi punu udari</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsuna tsugono tso okpoi upeci 1:1-17, 41</para>
  <para style="io2">a.Keniki Ilisha 1:1-8, 15 b.Ngono n Yahuda n mi Isaraila 8:16-17, 4 c. Uyikpi u Samariya 17, 5-41 Tsugono tsu Yahuda 18:1-25, 30 a. Hezekaya a kubana ayin a Josaya 18:1-21, 26 b.Tsugono tsu Josaya 22:1-23, 30 c Ngono mu ukocishi n Yahuda 23:31-24, 20 d.Uyikpi u Urushelima 25:1-30</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Afada a Vuzavaguɗu a kubana u mogono Ahaziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Ayin a na mogono Ahabu mi Isaraila ma̱ kuwa̱i, ɗa aza a Mowabu a yaꞋankai aza a Isaraila ugbamiwasuvu. <verse eid="2KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Kanna ke te Ahaziya mogono mi Isaraila ma̱ fa̱ta̱tsa̱i a kafalaka ka̱ kunu ku zuva ku ni a iɗika i Samariya ɗa ukai usa̱n. Ɗa u suki aza a usuki, u danai, &lt;&lt;Banai yi ece Baluzebu ka̱ma̱li ka̱ likuci i Ekoron, ko mɓa̱la̱ n va̱ n kuta̱na̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Ɗa kalingata ka Vuzavaguɗu ka danai Iliya vuza va aza a Tishibi, &lt;&lt;Ɗa̱nga̱, vu bana vu gasa n alingata a na mogono mi Isaraila ma̱ suki, uta̱i a Samariya. Ka̱ta̱ vu ece le, &lt;Ka̱shile kilo a Isaraila ba ɗa yi a kubana u BaꞋalu-zebu a̱ma̱li a Ekoron? <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Gogo na, ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗanna, vi a̱ kuɗa̱nga̱ a kajiba ka na vi ivaꞋin ya ba, vi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱.&gt; &gt;&gt; Ɗa Iliya u lazai.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Ayin a na aza a usuku a o bonoi u mogono, ɗa mogono me ecei le u danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa i bonoi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Ɗa a̱ ushuki mogono a danai, &lt;&lt;Vuma vu yoku u cina tsu ta̱ uye ɗa u danai tsu, &lt;Bonoi a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono ma na ma̱ suki ɗa̱ va i dana yi, ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗaɗa na. Ka̱shile ki ɗe a Isaraila ba? Ana i tsu suku uma a bana ece BaꞋalu-zebu ka̱ma̱li ka Ekoron? Adama a nannai vi a̱ kuɗa̱nga̱ a kajiba ka na vi a ivaꞋin ya ba, mayun vi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Ɗa Mogono me ecei le, &lt;&lt;VicuꞋu vuma vene ɗai u gasai n a̱ɗa̱, ɗa u danai ɗa̱ ili i nampa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Ɗa a̱ ushuki a danai, &lt;&lt;U uka ta̱ motogu mu ukpan u manama, n kaɗambura ku ukpan a̱ kukyun ku ni.&gt;&gt; Ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;Iliya ɗa vuza va aza a Tishibi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ suki kovonshi vo osoji n osoji amangere n kupa a bana e reme Iliya. Vuzagbayin vo osoji a u banai u Iliya ɗa u cinai ni ida̱shi a kusan, ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vuma vu Ka̱shile, mogono ma danai &lt;Cipa̱ a iɗika.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Iliya wu ushuki vuzagbayin vu osoji va, &lt;&lt;Mpa ɗa baci vuma vu Ka̱shile, yaꞋan akina a̱ uta̱ gaɗi o songu wu n osoji a̱ nu amangere n kupa.&gt;&gt; Gogo lo ɗa akina uta̱i gaɗi o songi vuzagbayin va n osoji amangere n kupa a̱ ni.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Ɗa mogono mo doku ma̱ suki vuzagbayin vi yoku n osoji amangere n kupa. Ɗa vuzagbayin va u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vuma vu Ka̱shile, mogono ma danai &lt;Cipa̱ gogo o.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Ama ɗa Ilisha wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa vuma vu Ka̱shile ɗa baci yaꞋan akina uta̱ gaɗi o songu wu n osoji amangere n kupa a̱ nu.&gt;&gt; Gogo lo ɗa akina a̱ Ka̱shile a̱ cipa̱i o songi vuzagbayin n osoji amangere n kupa.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Mogono mo doku ma̱ suki vuzagbayin vu osoji n uma amangere n kupa ali kutatsu. Ɗa vuzagbayin vu osoji va u kumbai gaɗi ɗa u kuɗa̱ngi u folonoi Iliya u danai. &lt;&lt;Vuma vu Ka̱shile, pana asuvayali a̱ va̱, vu ka̱sukpa̱ mu n uma amangere n kupa a nampa a agbashi a̱ nu. <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />La̱na̱, tsu na akina uta̱i zuva o songi aza a gbagbaꞋin osoji e re n uma ele. Mi ta̱ ufolu vu pana asuvayali a̱ va̱ vu isa wuma u va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Ɗa kalingata ka̱ Vuzavaguɗu ka danai Iliya, &lt;&lt;Cipa̱ i walaka ka̱ta̱ vu pana wovon ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Iliya u ɗa̱nga̱i u tonoi ni a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u mogono.<verse eid="2KI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Ɗa Iliya u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗaɗa na, &lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai vu suki alingata a kubana u BaꞋalu-zebu ka̱ma̱li ka̱ Ekoron, u yaꞋanka wu kula̱na̱ ko vi ta̱ a kulaꞋa? Ka̱shile ki lo a Isaraila ka na ka̱ ku ushuku keci ku nu ba? Adama a nannai, ali vu yaꞋin ili i nampa, vi a̱ kuɗa̱nga̱ a kajiba ka na vi a ivaꞋin ba. Vi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Ɗa Ahaziya u kuwa̱i, tsu na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka na ka̱ uta̱i a̱ una̱ u Iliya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 1:17">Ahaziya tana wi m maku ba, ɗa vuza ni Jehoram u lyaꞋi tsugono a̱ una̱ u ni, a yaꞋan ta̱ ili nampa a̱ ka̱ya̱ ke ire ko tsugono tsu Jehoram maku ma Jehoshafatu mogono ma Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Ahaziya ci ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">A ɗikai Iliya a kubana zuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Ayin a na Vuzavaguɗu u sheshei kuɗika Iliya a kubana zuva a kabatalikpau, Iliya ele n Ilisha ele uye cina a̱ uta̱ a Giliga. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Ɗa Iliya u danai Ilisha, &lt;&lt;Shamgba na, Vuzavaguɗu u dana mu ta̱ m bana e Betelu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:2">Ɗa Ilisha u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi baci m wuma ɗa kpamu vi n wuma mi a̱ kuka̱sukpa̱ wu ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa a lazai koɓolo.<verse eid="2KI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Ɗa ka̱kuma̱ ka eneki ka na ki e Betelu a̱ ta̱wa̱i ubuta̱ u Ilisha a danai, &lt;&lt;Vu yeve ta̱ ko anana ɗa Vuzavaguɗu wi a kuɗika vuzagbayin nu wa̱ nu?&gt;&gt; Ilisha wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;E n yeve ta̱,&gt;&gt; Ama paɗai bini.<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Ɗa Iliya u danai Ilisha, &lt;&lt;Shamgba na, Vuzavaguɗu u dana mu ta̱ m bana e Jeriko.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:4">Ɗa Ilisha wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi baci n wuma, ɗa mpa feu mi n wuma u nu mi a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ wu ba.&gt;&gt;Ɗa a lazai koɓolo a kubana e Jeriko.<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Ɗa ka̱kuma̱ ka eneki o yoku a na i e Jeriko a banai wu Ilisha ɗa e ecei ni a danai, &lt;&lt;Vu yeve ta̱ a na Vuzavaguɗu wi a kuɗika vuzagbayin vu nu wa̱ nu anana?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:5">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;E n yeve ta̱, ama paɗai bini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Ɗa kpamu Iliya u doku u danai Ilisha,&lt;&lt;Shamgba na, Vuzavaguɗu u dana mu ta̱ m bana e Kuyene ku Urudu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:6">Ɗa kpamu wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi baci n wuma, ɗa mpa feu mi n wuma u nu mi a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ wu ba.&gt;&gt;Ɗa a lazai aza e re le koɓolo.<verse eid="2KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Ɗa uma amangerenkupa a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱kuma̱ ka Eneki ka, o tonoi le a banai a shamgbai daꞋangi n ubuta̱ u na Iliya n Ilisha a shamgbai e Kuyene ku Urudu. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Iliya u foɗoi motogu ma gbanyin ma̱ ni u ka̱ta̱la̱i maꞋa, ɗa u lapai mini m motogu ma. Ɗa mini me pecei kure, a̱yi n Ilisha a pasai a iɗika i ɗekpu.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Ana a pasai kuyene ka, ɗa Iliya u danai Ilisha,&lt;&lt;Dana mu ili i na vu cigai n yaꞋanka wu babu a ɗika mu wu a̱ nu.&gt;&gt;Ilisha wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Neke mu ugboku u re wu utsura wa ayinviki a̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Iliya u danai vu ece ta̱ ili i na ya kuyaꞋan ba, ɗa baci ve enei makyan ma na a ku ɗika mu, vi ta̱ a ki isa ayinviki a. Ɗa ba tana ve enei makyan ma ba, vi a̱ kuciya̱ ili i na vu folonoi ba.<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Ana i nwalu a kadanshi, ko arabali ɗa keke vu odoku akina uta̱i e peci le. Ɗa kabatalikpau ka ɗikai Iliya a kubana zuva. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Ana Ilisha we enei nannai, ɗa uɓoshi ka̱da̱uri u danai, &lt;&lt;Esheku a̱ va̱, esheku a̱ va̱, avu na vu tsu keɗe aza a Isaraila u laꞋa e keke odoku n akumbi odoku,&gt;&gt; Ana u nambai ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:12">Ɗa u karai motogu ma̱ ni kure. <verse eid="2KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Ɗa u ɗikai motogu magbayi ma Iliya ma na ma̱ yikpa̱i ikyamba ni, ɗa u bonoi u shamgbai a̱ ka̱kina̱ ke Kuyene ku Urudu. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Ɗa u ɗikai motogu magbayi ma u lapai mini me Kuyene ku Urudu ka, ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Teɗai Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka Iliya?&gt;&gt; Ɗa kuyene ka ku pecei kure, ɗa Ilisha u pasai a kubana a̱ ka̱ga̱Ꞌin ka nan ɗe.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Ana ka̱ kunma̱i ke eneki a na i e Jeriko enei nannai ɗa a danai, utsura wa ayinviki a Iliya i ta̱ wu Ilisha, ɗa a banai wa̱ ni a̱ kuɗa̱ngi a̱ kya̱sa̱ ni. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />A danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ci ta̱ n ali utsura amangerenkupa punu agbashi a̱ nu. Vu ka̱sukpa̱ le a bana a̱ la̱nsa̱ vuzagbayin nu. Yoku ba ayinviki a Vuzavaguɗu a bankai ta̱ a kagaɗi ko yoku, ko a̱ ka̱ɗa̱ka̱i ko yoku.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:16">Ɗa Ilisha wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i suku le ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Ana a kpakalakai ni n kadanshi ali u nambai ili i kudansa. Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Suki le.&gt;&gt;Ɗa a̱ suki uma amangere n kupa ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i kula̱nsa̱ yi ali ayin a tatsu, ama ene yi ba. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Ana obonoi e Jeriko, a̱ ubuta̱ u na Ilisha u shamgbai. Ɗa u danai le, &lt;&lt;N dana ɗa̱, &lt;Ka̱ta̱ i bana ba?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilisha u gita̱i kuyaꞋan ili mereve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Uma a̱ likuci i Jeriko a banai wu Ilisha a danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin, vu yeve ta̱ likuci i nampa ya yi ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ usingai. Ama mini ma̱ likuci ma magaꞋan ba, ma tsu zuwa ta̱ iɗika yo okpo babu tsuta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Ɗa Ilisha u danai, &lt;&lt;Tukai mu n masasu ma savu nu mkpaɗi punu.&gt;&gt; Ɗa a̱ tuka̱i ni.<verse eid="2KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Ɗa u banai a̱ ubuta̱ u na a̱shi a̱ mini a i ɗa u tsungi punu mkpaɗi ma, ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u danai, ili i na i ɗikai anana m lapula ta̱ mini ma ra̱ka̱. Mini ma mi o kudoku ma̱ tuka̱ n ukpa̱ ko ukpa̱ɗi u kumatsa ili a iɗika ya ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Ɗa mini ma mo okpoi ugaꞋin a ayin a nanlo ali a̱ kuta̱wa̱ anana. Tsu na Ilisha u dansai. <verse eid="2KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Ana Ilisha u ka̱sukpa̱i Jeriko a kubana e Betelu, a̱yi uye ɗa u gasai m muku molobo n yoku aza a na uta̱i a̱ likuci. Ɗa muku ma n gita̱i ku zoꞋoso yi &lt;&lt;Wala, vuza kukpani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Ilisha u vadalukpai wu indai le ɗa u yaꞋankai le una n kula ku Vuzavaguɗu. Ɗa a̱kunzu e re uta̱i a̱ kuntsu a karasai muku molobo amangere n e re. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Ɗa Ilisha u banai a kusan ku Kamelu ali u bonoi Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ugbamiwasuvu wa aza a Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n kula̱i ko tsugono ka Johoshafatu mogono ma Yahuda, ɗa Jehoram maku ma Ahabu wo okpoi mogono ma Isaraila a Samariya. Jehoram u lyaꞋi tsugono a̱ya̱ kupa n e re. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />U yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu, ama kagbanigbani ka̱ ni ka yawa ke esheku a̱ ni n a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ba. Adama a na u takpa ta̱ kululu ku katali ka̱ a̱ma̱li a Balu aza a na esheku a̱ ni a yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />N nannai dem, u lyai kelime n kagbanigbani ka Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu, vuza na u zuwai aza a Isaraila a yaꞋin unushi, tana u ka̱sa̱kpa̱ ba.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Mesha mogono ma Mowabu maguɓi ma n nkyon ma a. Ka̱ya̱ dem u tsu neke ta̱ mogono ma Isaraila utafu wu nkyon a̱kpa̱n amangatawun (100,000) N cileme tsu a̱giri a̱kpa̱n amangatawun (100,000) wu nkyon. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Ayin ana mogono Ahabu ma Isaraila ma̱ kuwa̱i, ɗa mogono ma Mowabu ma yaꞋankai mogono ma Isaraila ugbamiwasuvu. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Ɗa Jehoram mogono ma Isaraila ma̱ uta̱i a Samariya ɗa u ɓolongi osoji a Isaraila adama o kuvon. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Ɗa u suki na akaka a kubana u mogono Johoshafatu vuza va aza a Yahuda u danai &lt;&lt;Mogono ma Mowabu ma yaꞋanka mu ta̱ ugbamiwasuvu. Vi ta̱ a kubana nu mpa tsu yaꞋan kuvon n Mowabu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:7">Ɗa Johoshafatu wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;E, mi ta̱ a kubana n avu. Mpa tsu nu tsu ɗa mi osoji a̱va̱ a̱ nu a ɗa odoku a̱va̱ kpamu a̱ nu a ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Johoshafatu we ecei, &lt;&lt;Uye wenei u ɗai tsa kutono?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:8">Jehoram u danai, &lt;&lt;Uye u na u tonoi n kakamba ka Edom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Mogono ma Isaraila n mogono ma Yahuda, n mogono ma Edom ɗa a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i a lazai. Ana a yaꞋin ayin e cindere ele a̱ ku ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱, ali a yawai a̱ ubuta̱ u na babu mini mo kusoꞋo a dama osoji ele nu nnama na mi n ele.<verse eid="2KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Ɗa mogono ma Isaraila ma danai, &lt;&lt;Nini ɗai tsa kuyaꞋan, Vuzavaguɗu u ɓolongu tsu ta̱ matatsu ma̱ tsu adama a na mogono ma mowabu wu una tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Ɗa Johoshafatu u danai, &lt;&lt;Keneki ka Vuzavaguɗu ki punu na ba vuza vuna wa kuyaꞋan kene ili i na Vuzavaguɗu wi a kuciga ba?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:11">Vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka za̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a Isaraila u danai, &lt;&lt;Ilisha maku ma Shafatu, vuza vuna u yaꞋankai Iliya ulinga, wi ta̱ lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Johoshafatu u danai, kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ki ta̱ n a̱yi. Adama nannai ɗa mogono mi Isaraila, n mogono ma Yahuda, n mogono ma Edom ɗa a banai a̱ ubuta̱ u Ilisha.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Ilisha u danai mogono mi Isaraila, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i gasai mu n avu? Bana a̱ ubuta̱ u eneki e esheku a̱ nu n eneki a̱na̱ku a̱ nu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 3:13">Ama mogono mi Isaraila u danai, &lt;&lt;Ko ili, Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u ɓolongi tsu ngono n tatsu adama a na u neke tsu ekiye aza a mowabu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Ilisha wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili wi baci n wuma, vuza na mi o kutono, ishi ba adama a na mi e kuneke Johoshafatu mogono ma Yahuda tsugbayin ba, ko kindana mi ishi a kindana wu ba. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Gogo na tuka̱i mu n vuza na u tsuwaꞋa a umolu.&gt;&gt; A makyan ma na wi a kuwaꞋa umolu, ɗa utsura u Vuzavaguɗu u cipa̱i wi Ilisha. <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗan na, &lt;I ga̱va̱ ayinva a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka nampa ka.&gt; <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Vuzavaguɗu u danai, &lt;Yi e kene wunla̱i ko mini ma̱ Ka̱shile ba, ama ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ki ta̱ a kushana m mini, ali a̱ ɗa̱ n anaka a̱ ɗa̱ nnama n na n buwai yi ta̱ o kusoꞋo.&gt; <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Ili ya atakaci i ɗa ba u Vuzavaguɗu, wi ta̱ a̱ kuneke aza a Mowabu e kiye a̱ɗa̱. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Yi ta̱ a ki isa likuci yi ukanji n likuci i singai. Yi ta̱ kpamu a kukapa nɗanga n na n kuyaꞋan ulinga, ka̱ta̱ i votsuku a̱shi a̱ mini, n atali a ɗa i kula̱nga̱sa̱ ashina a singai ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />N usana makyan ma na a ci yaꞋan alyuka, ɗa mini ma̱ uta̱i uɓon Edom ma shanai a̱ ubuta̱ ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Ana aza a Mowabu a panai ngono n tatsu ma uta̱ ta̱ kuyaꞋan kuvon n ele, ɗa muku m ali aza a na a yawai kuɓa̱na̱ ucanuku u kuvon, ili i na i ɗikai maku a kubana u vuzagbayin, a zuwai le uteku wu i ɗikai i le. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Ana kayin kasai ɗa a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i, a na kutashi ku kanna ka ku akanai mini ma ɗa mini ma ma shilyamgbai a na mpasa. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Uma a Mowabu oɓoshi ka̱da̱uri a danai, &lt;&lt;Mpasa n ɗa, mayun ngono n nampa unanai ta̱. Uma a Mowabu ta̱wa̱i tsu banai, tsu pura̱ ucanuku u gbani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Ana a yawai a̱ ubuta̱ kuvon wa aza a Isaraila, ɗa uma Isaraila uta̱i ni ilaɗi a lyaꞋi le n kuvon ali a sumai. Osoji a Isaraila a guvai le ali a kubana a iɗika i Mowabu n unai le. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />A̱ la̱nga̱sa̱i le likuci, ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i ku varuku atali ashina ele ali a palai aɗa. Ɗa o votsuki a̱shi a̱ mini ele, ɗa kpamu a kapai nɗanga n singai n ele. Kiru-haresetu ɗa koci u buwai, ama osoji a na i n a̱vingba̱tsu a ɗa ka̱ra̱Ꞌi i ɗa a lyaꞋi i ɗa n kuvon.<verse eid="2KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Ayin ana mogono ma Mowabu ma zukai kuvon ki ta̱ a kulyaꞋa yi, ɗa u ɗikai osoji amangatawencindere (700) aza a kuvon n otokobi, adama a na wu uta̱ n kapashi ko osoji a Edom u suma, am u fuɗa ba. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Ɗa u ɗikai maku ma ugiti ma̱ ni vuza na u kulyaꞋa tsugono a̱ una̱ u ni, u yaꞋankai kuneꞋe ku kusongu a mashilya ma̱ likuci ma. Adama nannai, aza a Isaraila a yaꞋin wupa u gbani-gbani ɗa o rononoi o bonoi a i ɗikai i le.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ilisha u ɓa̱nka̱i kagapa ka vuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Kanna kete vuka vu keneki kete punu a̱ ka̱kuma̱ ke eneki u banai u Ilisha, u bankai ni n ma̱shi u danai, &lt;&lt;Kagbashi ka̱ nu vali va̱ u kuwa̱ ta̱. Vi yeve ta̱ a na vuza vu wovon u Vuzavaguɗu ɗa. Ama ɗanna vuza yoku na wi o kutono yi kutan u ta̱wa̱i kuɗika muku n e re n va̱ mo okpo agbashi a̱ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Ilisha we ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i ma kuyaꞋanka wu? Dana mu, yiɗa̱i vi ni i ɗa a kpaꞋa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:2">Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Kagbashi ka̱ nu ki n ili a kpaꞋa ba sai kedele ka maniꞋin ma zaitu koci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Ilisha u danai vuka va, &lt;&lt;Bana vu ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ aza a̱ nu, vu folono edele a maniꞋin a na i n ili ba, vu folono a ɗa n a̱bunda̱i. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Ka̱ta̱ vu uwa a̱ kunu, n muku mo olobo n nu, i gbagura utsutsu. Ka̱ta̱ i tsuwa̱n maniꞋin ma punu edele a. Kedele ka na baci ka shanai, i zuwai kaꞋa a kakanbu ka̱ta̱ i lyaꞋa kelime n kutsungu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Ɗa vuka va vu lazai. Ɗa u uwai a̱ kunu koɓolo n muku mo olobo n ni, ɗa a gbagurai utsutsu. A̱ gita̱i ku tsungu maniꞋin ma Zaitu ma, muku n ni a̱ kutusa̱ka̱ n edele, a̱yi n utsungi punu maniꞋin ma. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Ana edele a maniꞋin a shanai ra̱ka̱, ɗa u danai maku ma̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Tuka̱ n kedele ko yoku.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:6">&lt;&lt;Ɗa u danai ni, babu kedele ko yoku.&gt;&gt; Ɗa maniꞋin ma ka̱sukpa̱i kutsuwa̱n.<verse eid="2KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Ɗa u banai u danai Ilisha vuma vu Ka̱shile, ɗa u danai vuka va, bana vu denge maniꞋin ma, ka̱ta̱ vu tsupa kutan ka, kagimi ka na ka buwai ka ɗaɗa ka̱ kuɓa̱na̱ wu n muku n nu.<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilisha u ɗa̱ngusa̱i maku ma vuka vuza va aza a Shunemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Kanna kete Ilisha u banai a̱ likuci i Shunemu, a̱ ubuta̱ u na vuka vu uciyi vi yoku vi. Ɗa vuka va vu danai ni u ta̱wa̱ u lyaꞋa ilikulya a kpaꞋa ku ni. Ɗa wo okpoi a makyan ma na baci wi a kupasamgbanai lo dem, u tsu shamgba ta̱ u lyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Ɗa u danai vali vu ni, &lt;&lt;Babu munla̱i vuma vu na u ta̱wa̱ na va vuma vu ciɗa vu Ka̱shile ɗa. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Ci yaꞋanka yi maku ma̱ kunu kenu zuva vu kpaꞋa kutsu, ka̱ta̱ tsu lapulaka yi kuɗa. Tsu zuwaka yi ivaꞋamkpatsu n kirukpa n kakuba n ma̱kuni. Adama a na u ciya̱ ubuta̱ u kucipa̱ ɗa baci u ta̱wa̱i dem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Kanna kete ana Ilisha u ta̱wa̱i a̱ likuci Shunemu, ɗa u kumbai gaɗi a̱ kunu ku ni a dama a na wu uvuka. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Ɗa u danai Gehazi vuza na u ci yaꞋanka yi ulinga &lt;&lt;Ɗeke vuka va.&gt;&gt; Ana u ɗeke ni, Ɗa u uwai u shamgbai kelime ka̱ ni. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Ilisha u danai ni &lt;&lt;Dana vuka va, &lt;An wo okpoi vu yaꞋanka tsu ta̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, yiɗa̱i va kuciga n yaꞋanka wu? Vu ciga ta̱ n yaꞋanka mogono kadanshi ko n yaꞋanka kovonshi vo osoji kadanshi?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:13">Ɗa wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱, mi ta̱ n uma a̱va̱, a na e kuneke mu ili i na n cigai ra̱ka̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Ilisha we ecei Gehazi, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i n kuyaꞋanka yi?&gt;&gt; Gehazi u danai, &lt;&lt;Wi n maku mo kolobo ba, tana vali vi ni vu kutsa ta̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Ɗa Ilisha u danai, &lt;&lt;Ɗekei ni u ta̱wa̱ na.&gt;&gt; Ana u ɗeke ni, ɗa u ta̱wa̱i u shamgbai u tsutsu. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Ilisha u danai vuka va, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ya̱ ka̱ kuta̱wa̱ a makyan ma nampa vi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱na̱ maku mo kolobo ma̱ nu n a̱ kiye a̱ nu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:16">Ɗa u danai &lt;&lt;A̱Ꞌa̱, vuzagbayin vu va̱, vuma vu Ka̱shile, ka̱ta̱ vu doro mu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Vuka va tana vu yaꞋin ka̱tsuma̱, a na ka̱ya̱ ko bonoi ɗa u matsai maku mo kolobo derere a makyan ma na u danai ni.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Ana maku ma mo gbonguroi, ɗa kanna kete u banai u cinai esheku a̱ ni, a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza a ulinga.<verse eid="2KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Babu arabali, &lt;&lt;Ɗa u lapai una̱ u danai esheku a̱ ni, kaci ka̱ va̱, kaci ka̱ va̱,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:19">Ɗa esheku a̱ ni a danai kagbashi kete, &lt;&lt;Ɗika yi vu banka a̱na̱ku a̱ ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Ana u bankai a̱na̱ku a, ɗa u keɓe ni a̱ nkuta̱ ali kanna ke pecei, ɗa u kuwa̱i. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Ɗa u ɗikai maku ma u kumbai zuva a̱ kunu ku vuma vu Ka̱shile va, ɗa u vaꞋankai maku ma a ivaꞋamkpatsu i ni, u gbagurai utsutsu wa ɗa wu uta̱i.<verse eid="2KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Ɗa u ɗekei vali vi ni u danai, &lt;&lt;N folono wu ta̱ suꞋuku mu n kagbashi kete m majaki, adama a na n suma a kubana u vuma vu Ka̱shile gogoꞋo ka̱ta̱ m bono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Vali vi ni ve ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i ɗa vi a kubana wu a̱ ni anana? Ka̱ɗiva̱ ko wotoi u savu ka a ba, kpamu anana Ashibi a ɗa feu ba.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:23">Ɗa wu ushuki u danai,&lt;&lt;Babu ko yoku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />U foɓusoi majaki ma. Ɗa u danai kagbashi ka,&lt;&lt;Zuwa majaki ma ma dakaka, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sa̱kpa̱i u wala sawu ba sai n dana wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Ɗa u ka̱na̱i uye, u banai a̱ ubuta̱ u vuma vu Ka̱shile va a kusan kugbayin ku Kamelu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:25">Ana vuma vu Ka̱shile we enei vuka va a̱ kuta̱wa̱, ɗa u danai Gehazi, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, vuza va aza a Shunama ɗa lo a̱ kuta̱wa̱. <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Suma vu gasa n a̱yi, ka̱ta̱ ve ece yi, &lt;Vu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ gbaga? Vali vu nu vi ta̱ gbaga? Maku ma̱ nu tana?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:26">Ɗa wu ushuki u danai,&lt;&lt;Babu ko yoku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Ana u yawai a̱ ubuta̱ u vuma vu Ka̱shile va a kusan ka, ɗa u remei ene a̱ ni. Ɗa Gehazi u ta̱wa̱i u ka̱Ꞌa̱ngu ni, ɗa vuma vu Ka̱shile va u danai,&lt;&lt;Ka̱sukpa̱ yi, adama a na wi ta̱ n una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱u. Vuzavaguɗu tana u sokongu mu ta̱, u dana mu ko yiɗa̱i ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Ɗa vuka va vu danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin n folono u ta̱ maku? N dana wu ba, &lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu doro mu ba?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Ɗa Ilisha u danai Gehazi, &lt;&lt;Foɓuso vu ɗika kalangu ka̱va̱ e kukiye ku nu, ka̱ta̱ vu suma vu bana a kpaꞋa ku vuka ka. Vu gasa baci n vuma ka̱ta̱ vu kya̱sa̱ yi ba. Ɗa baci tana vuza yoku u kya̱sa̱i nu, ka̱ta̱ vu ushuku yi ba. Vu vaꞋanku yi kalangu ka̱va̱ ka a̱ a̱shi a maku a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Ama a̱na̱ku a maku a, a danai Ilisha, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi baci n wuma, mi a̱ kuka̱sukpa̱ wu ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u ɗa̱nga̱i u banai n a̱yi.<verse eid="2KI 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehazi u lazai kelime ɗa u vaꞋankai kalangu ka a̱ a̱shi a maku ma, ama ko izumgbi, kpamu ko urotu u wuma. Ɗa Gehazi u bonoi kugasa n Ilisha a na wa dana yi, &lt;&lt;Maku ma ma̱ ɗa̱nga̱ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Ana Ilisha u yawai a kpaꞋa ka, ɗa u cinai a vaꞋankai keven ka ikyamba ka a ivaꞋamkpatsu i ni. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Ɗa u uwai punu u gbagurai utsutsu, a̱yi n maku ma koci, u yaꞋin avasa u Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Ɗa u vaki a̱ ma̱ka̱nga̱ ma maku ma, u zuwai una̱ u ni a̱ una̱ u maku wa a̱shi a̱ ni kpamu a̱ a̱shi a maku a, n a̱ ekiye a̱ ni a̱ ekiye a maku a. Ana u ba̱rukpa̱i ka̱ci ka̱ ni a ikyamba i maku ya, ɗa ikyamba i maku ya i suɗukpai. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Ilisha u ɗa̱nga̱i u ka̱na̱i nwalu a kubana n u bonoi a̱ kunu. Ɗa u doku u ba̱rukpa̱i ka̱ci ka̱ ni a ikyamba i maku ya. Ɗa maku ma ma dishai kucindere, ɗa u paɗukpai a̱shi a̱ ni.<verse eid="2KI 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Ilisha u ɗekei Gehazi u danai, &lt;&lt;Ɗeke a̱na̱ku a maku a, vuza va aza a Shunama a̱ ta̱wa̱.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u ɗekei vuka va. Ana u uwai ɗa Ilisha u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ɗika maku ma̱ nu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Ɗa u ta̱wa̱i u kuɗa̱ngi e ene a̱ ni, u kuɗa̱ngi ali iɗika, ɗa u ɗikai maku ma̱ ni wu uta̱i.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilisha u takpai yaza o mogbodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Ilisha u bonoi a Gilga, u cinai kambulu a iɗika ya. Kanna kete a na ka̱kuma̱ ke eneki ki ida̱shi koɓolo n a̱yi, ɗa u danai kagbashi ka̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Daɓamgu mogbodo magbayin akina, vu yaꞋanka eneki ilikulyaꞋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Vuza vu te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a ulinga a u uwai a kakamba kula̱nsa̱ itacishi. Ɗa u taɓai umaci u ni u shatangi motogu ma̱ ni, ana u bonokoi a kpaꞋa. Ɗa u miryai u tsungi o mogbodo mi ilikulya ya, babu vuza na u yeve ko yiɗa̱i. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Ɗa a̱ tsuwa̱nka̱i uma adama a na a lyaꞋa. Ana i punu a kulyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa ya, ɗa o ɓosoi ka̱da̱wuri a danai, &lt;&lt;Vuma vu Ka̱shile, yaza yi ta̱ punu o mogbodo ma.&gt;&gt; Ɗa a iwain kulyaꞋa ilikulyaꞋa ya. <verse eid="2KI 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Ilisha u danai, &lt;&lt;A̱ tuka̱ n kiya.&gt;&gt; Ana a̱ tukai, ɗa u tsungi punu o mogbodo mi ilikulyaꞋa ya ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Pecekei uma adama a na a lyaꞋa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa tana wo okpoi nannai babu koyoku.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilisha u lyaꞋatangi uma amangatawun (100)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Vuma vu yoku wu uta̱i a Balu-shelisha, u tuka̱i vuma vu Ka̱shile n a̱kutsu o boroji kamanga a na a yaꞋin n ili i kashina i nai gita̱i kugeꞋwe. Koɓolo n aza a̱ ta̱ku a kaburma ka̱ ni. Ɗa Ilisha u danai,&lt;&lt;Nekei uma adama a na a lyaꞋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Ama kagbashi ka̱ ni ka danai, &lt;&lt;Vi ta̱ e kene adanshi i ɗa yi ta̱ a kuyawa uma amangatawun?&gt;&gt; Ilisha u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Neke le a lyaꞋa, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u dana ta̱, &lt;I ta̱ a ku lyaꞋa ali a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ kagimi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Ɗa kagbashi ka ka nekei le ilikulyaꞋa, ɗa a lyaꞋi ali a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kagimi, tsu na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka dansai.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">O potsokpoi NaꞋaman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />NaꞋaman kovonshi vo osoji o mogono ma Siriya. U ciya̱ ta̱ tsugbayin a̱ ubuta̱ vuzagbayin vi ni kpamu wi ta̱ a kupana u yoꞋo u ni, adama a na n kukiye ku ni kuɗa Vuzavaguɗu u nekei aza a Siriya ulyaꞋi kuvon. A̱yi kosoji ka ka na ka fuɗai kuvon, ama wi ta̱ nu mɓa̱la̱ ma̱ ukutu.<verse eid="2KI 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Ana aza a Siriya a bankai Isaraila kuvon, ɗa a ɗikai maku me mekere ɗe a iɗika ya, ɗa wo okpoi kagbashi ka vuka vu NaꞋaman. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Kanna kete ɗa mekere ma ma danai vuka vu NaꞋaman, &lt;&lt;Ishi baci vali vu nu wi ta̱ a kubana u keneki ka na ki a̱ likuci i Samariya, wi ishi ku potsokpo yi mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu n ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Ɗa NaꞋaman u banai u danai vuzagbayin vi ni,&lt;&lt;Ili i na mekere ma na ma̱ uta̱i a Isaraila va ma danai ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Ɗa mogono ma Siriya ma danai, &lt;&lt;Bana, mi ta̱ a kuɗana katagarda ka akaka a kubana u mogono mi Isaraila.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:5">Ɗa NaꞋaman u ɗa̱nga̱i u ɗikai azurufa a̱kpa̱n kamangankupa (30,000) n na azanariya a̱kpa̱n a̱ ta̱li (6,000), n ntogu n kuꞋuka kupa. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />U bankai mogono mi Isaraila n katagarda ka na ka danai, &lt;&lt;N katagarda ka nampa kaꞋa mi a̱ ku suꞋuku wu kagbashi ka̱ va̱ NaꞋaman. N ciga ta̱ vu potsokpo yi mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu u ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Ana mogono mi Isaraila me kecei katagarda ka, ɗa gogo lo u karasai ntogu n ni adama u na̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma̱ u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa Ka̱shile kaꞋa, vuza vu na wa kuna ko vuza vu na u kuneke wuma? Adama yiɗa̱i ɗa mogono ma Siriya maku suꞋuku n akaka m potsokpo vuza vu mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu? La̱na̱ biꞋi tsu na vuma vu nampa wi a kuzama mu vishili.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Ana Ilisha vuma vu Ka̱shile u panai a danai mogono mi Isaraila ma karasai n ntogu n ni, ɗa u suꞋuki ni n akaka u danai, &lt;&lt;Adama a yiɗa̱i ɗa vu karasai ntogu n nu? Dana vuma va u ta̱wa̱ wu a̱va̱, wi ta̱ e kuyeve a na keneki ki punu a Isaraila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Ɗa NaꞋaman u banai na̱ odoku a̱ ni n ekeke odoku a̱ ni, u shamgbai u tsutsu kpaꞋa ku Ilisha. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Ilisha u suki vuza vu usuki u danai NaꞋaman &lt;&lt;Bana e Kuyene ku Urudu vu sumba̱ kucindere punu a̱ mini ma, ukpan wi ikyamba i nu yi ta̱ a̱ kupotso yo okpo gbaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Ɗa NaꞋaman u lazai n wupa, n u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa n sheshe ta̱ ko keneki ka ki ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱va̱, ka̱ta̱ u shamgba e kelime ka̱ va̱, u yaꞋan avasa u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ni, ka̱ta̱ u ɗa̱ngusa̱ kukiye ku ni a̱ ubuta̱ wu ukutu wa adama a na u potsokpo mu. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Kuyene ku Abana n kuyene ku Faraparu nɗolu n re a Dimaska n nanlo, a laꞋa mini mi Isaraila ra̱ka̱ ba? Ishi baci m sumba̱ ta̱ e kute mi ishi a̱ kupotso.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u kpatalai n wupa u lazai.<verse eid="2KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Agbashi a NaꞋaman a̱ ta̱wa̱i wa̱ ni ɗa a danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin, ishi baci keneki ka̱ Ka̱shile ka u dana wu ta̱ vu yaꞋin ili i gbayin i yoku, vi a kuyaꞋan ba? Adama a na u danai nu, &lt;Bana vu sumba̱ koci vi ta̱ a̱ o kupotso?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Ɗa NaꞋaman u gida̱la̱i a kubana o Kuyene ku Urudu ɗa u liɓai kucindere tsu na vuma vu Ka̱shile u danai. Ɗa ukpan wu ikyamba i ni yo okpoi a na ikyamba i maku, ɗa u potsoi.<verse eid="2KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Ɗa NaꞋaman n uma a̱ ni o bonoi a̱ ubuta̱ u vuma vu Ka̱shile va. U yawai u shamgbai e kelime ka Ilisha ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Gogo na n yeve ta̱ babu Ka̱shile ko yoku aduniyan a nampa sai a Isaraila koci. Mi ta̱ ufolu u nu, vuzagbayin, isa kuneꞋe ku kagbashi ka̱ nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Ilisha wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi baci n wuma, vuza na mi a kucikpa, mi a kisa ili ba.&gt;&gt; NaꞋaman u gutsakai ni wi isa, ɗa u iwain.<verse eid="2KI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Ɗa NaꞋaman u danai, &lt;&lt;Vi baci a kisa ba, ka̱sukpa̱ mu kagbashi ka̱ nu n kenuku kayala ka̱ likuci i nu tsu na odoku e re a kufuɗa kuɗika a banka mu a kpaꞋa. Adama a na mi o kudoku ma yaꞋan kuneꞋe wa̱ a̱ma̱li o yoku ba, sai u Vuzavaguɗu koci. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Ama yaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u cinukpaka kagbashi ka̱ ni unushi u ni adama ili i te i nampa. Ɗa baci n tonoi vuzagbayin va̱ a ku uwa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Rimon adama a kucikpa, yaꞋan Vuzavaguɗu u cinukpaka kagbashi ka̱ ni ɗa baci feu n kuɗa̱nki ka̱ ka̱ma̱li ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Ɗa Ilisha u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Wala m ma̱ta̱na̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Ama a na NaꞋaman u lazai daꞋangi. <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Ɗa Gehazi ka gbashi ka Ilisha, vuma vu Ka̱shile, u sheshei a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni u danai, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, tsu na, vuzagbayin va̱ u ka̱sukpa̱i NaꞋaman vuza va aza a Siriya nanlo u lazai nanai. Wi isa ili wa̱ ni ba, Vuzavaguɗu wi baci n wuma, mi ta̱ o kutono yi mi isa ili yoku wa̱ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Ɗa Gehazi u tonoi NaꞋaman n ilaɗi. Ana NaꞋaman we enei ni a̱ kuta̱wa̱ wa̱ ni n ilaɗi, ɗa u cipa̱i ekeke vu odoku u gasai n a̱yi u danai, &lt;&lt;Yi ɗai i gita̱i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Gehazi wushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Gbaga ko ili. Vuzagbayin va̱ ɗa u suki mu wa̱ nu u danai &lt;Gogo na ɗa eneki e re a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka eneki a̱ ta̱wa̱i wa̱ va̱ a̱ likuci ya aginda i Ifirayimu. I ta̱ ufolu vu neke le azurufa a̱kpa̱n a tatsu (3,000) n ntogu kuꞋuka kure.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />NaꞋaman wu shuku u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ufolu nu vi isa azurufa a̱kpa̱n a̱ ta̱li.&gt;&gt; (6,000) u gutsakai Gehazi wi isa azurufa a̱kpa̱n a̱ ta̱li a, ɗa u ka̱ta̱la̱ ka̱ ni an njaki n e re, koɓolo n ntogu kuꞋuka kure. U danai agbashi e re a ɗikaka Gehazi a kubana a kpaꞋa. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Ana a yawai a kaginda ɗevu n kpaꞋa ku Ilisha, ɗa Gehazi wi isai ucanuku wa ekiye agbashi a, u ukai a kpaꞋa. Ɗa u danai le a kpatala o kubono. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Gehazi u uwai a kpaꞋa u shamgbai e kelime ka vuzagbayin vi ni. Ɗa Ilisha we ecei ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">&lt;&lt;Teɗai vi ishi vu banai, Gehazi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:25">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Kagbashi ka̱ nu kabana a̱ ubuta̱ u yoku ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Ilisha u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ɗu ka̱ va̱ ka dana mu ta̱ ana vuma va u cipa̱i ekeke vu odoku a̱ ni u gasai n avu. Ɗa vi isai ikebe, n ntogu, n kashina ka nɗanga n zaitu n kashina ki itacishi, n lala, n ushiga wa anaka, n agbashi a̱ma̱ci n ali? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Adama nannai mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu n NaꞋaman mi ta̱ o kubono wa̱ nu n uma a̱ nu ali uteku n uteku.&gt;&gt; Gehazi wu uta̱i wu Ilisha n mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu ɗa wa̱ruma̱i kparasha.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ilisha u zuwai vuyum vu kogovu vu ta̱ɗukpa̱i a mala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Kanna kete ɗa ka̱kuma̱ ke eneki a danai Ilisha, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, a̱ ubuta̱ u na ci ida̱shi u yaꞋan ta̱ kenu. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />YaꞋan tsu bana e Kuyene ku Urudu a̱ ubuta̱ u na tsa kukapa ogboli a nɗanga. Ka̱ta̱ tsu doku ubuta̱ wu ida̱shi u na u kuyawa tsu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:2">Ɗa wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Banai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Ɗa vuza te punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke eneki ka, &lt;&lt;U gutsakai Ilisha u bana koɓolon n ele.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:3">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ a kubana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Ɗa u banai n ele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:4">Ana a yawai e Kuyene ku Urudu, ɗa a̱ gita̱i kukapa nɗanga. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Ana vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le wi a kukapa maɗanga, ɗa kogovu ka ke shemgbei ka̱ yikpa̱i a̱ mini. Ɗa vuma va u ɓosoi ka̱da̱wuri u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin va̱, kogovu ko okopu kaꞋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Ilisha we ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Teɗai ka ka̱ yikpa̱i?&gt;&gt; Ana u yotsongi ni ubuta̱ wa, ɗa Ilisha u koɗoi macaka u variki a̱ ubuta̱ wa, ɗa vuyum vu kogovu ka ka̱ ta̱ɗukpa̱i. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Ilisha u danai &lt;&lt;Ɗika kaꞋa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u ukai kukiye u ɗikai kaꞋa.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilisha u lyaꞋi osoji a Siriya n kuvon.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Kanna ko yoku an mogono ma Siriya mi o kuvon n aza a Isaraila, u la̱nsa̱i odoki a̱ ubuta̱ wa osoji a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a̱ ni u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta a kuzuwa a̱tsura̱ a̱ va̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kaku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Ɗa Ilisha vuma vu Ka̱shile u suki n katagarda ka akaka a kubana u mogono mi Isaraila u danai, &lt;&lt;Zukai, ka̱ta̱ i tono ubuta̱ u nampa ba, adama a na aza a Siriya i ta̱ a̱ kugida̱la̱ a kubana ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Ɗa mogono mi Isaraila ma̱ suki uma a bana a̱ la̱na̱ ubuta̱ u na vuma vu Ka̱shile va u danai. Ayin tutu Ilisha u tsu ɓarangu ta̱ mogono, u yongo ufoɓushi adama a̱ ubuta̱ u nanlo.<verse eid="2KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Ɗa Mogono ma Siriya ma̱ na̱mgba̱i ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱u. U ɓolongi osoji a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a̱ ni we ecei le, &lt;&lt;Yayi u tsu banka n kadanshi ka̱ tsu u mogono mi Isaraila?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Ɗa vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le wu ushuki u danai, &lt;&lt;Ko vuza, vuzagbayin mogono, Ilisha keneki ka Isaraila ka a ka tsu dana mogono mi Isaraila kadanshi ka na vu tsu dansa, ko a̱ kunu ku asa ku nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Ɗa mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;Banai i la̱nsa̱ ubuta̱ u na Ilisha wi, adama a na n suku e reme yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗa a panai arabali &lt;&lt;Wi ta̱ a Dotan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ suki osoji a̱ bunda̱i, n odoku, n ekeke odoku a kubana ɗe. A banai n kayin a kanzai likuci ya.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Makyan ma na kagbashi ka vuma vu Ka̱shile u ɗa̱nga̱i n usana wu uta̱i, ɗa we enei osoji, n odoku n ekeke odoku a kanzai likuci ya. Ɗa kagbashi ka ko orukpoi ka danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin va̱, yiɗa̱i tsa kuyaꞋan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Ɗa u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu pana wovon ba, adama a na aza a na i koɓolo n a̱tsu, a laꞋa ta̱ aza a na i koɓolon n ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Ɗa Ilisha u yaꞋan avasa u Vuzavaguɗu u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu, mi ta̱ ufolu u nu, ɓa̱yuwa̱ a̱shi a̱ ni adama a na we ene.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Ka̱shile ka̱ ɓa̱yuwa̱i a̱shi a kagbashi a, a na u la̱nuki ɗa we enei nsansa tukpa n odoku n ekeke odoku akina uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n Ilisha.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Ana aza a Siriya a yawai ɗevu adama a na a yaꞋan kuvon n a̱yi, ɗa Ilisha u yaꞋin avasa u Vuzavaguɗu u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ ufolu u nu zuwa uma a nampa a a̱ yimba̱na̱&gt;&gt; Ɗa tana u zuwai a̱shi le a̱ yimba̱na̱i tsu na Ilisha u folonoi.<verse eid="2KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Ɗa Ilisha u danai le, &lt;&lt;Uye u ɗaɗa ba, kpamu likuci i ɗaɗa ba. Tonoi mu, mi ta̱ a kubanka ɗa̱ u vuza vu na yi a̱ kula̱nsa̱.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u pura̱i le a kubana a Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Gogo lo a na a uwai a̱ likuci i Samariya, ɗa Ilisha u vasai u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu ɓa̱yuwa̱ a̱shi ele adama a na e ene.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u ɓa̱yuwa̱i a̱shi ele ɗa enei ka̱ci ka̱ le e mere ma aza a Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Ana mogono mi Isaraila me enei le ɗa u danai Ilisha, &lt;&lt;Vuzagbayin va̱, mu una le? Mu una le?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Ilisha wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu una le ba. Vi ta̱ a ku una aza a na vu remei a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon n kotokobi ka̱ nu? NeꞋe ele ilikulyaꞋa n mini mo kusoꞋo, ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ le o bono u vuzagbayin vi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Ɗa mogono mi Isaraila mo foɓusoi ka̱ɗiva̱ kagbayin adama e le. Ana a lyaꞋi o soꞋi, ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i le obonoi u vuzagbayin vi le. A makyan ma nanlo aza a Siriya o doku a banka aza a Isaraila kuvon ba.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ben-hadadu u kanzai Samariya n kuvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Ayin a na ilo Ben-hadadu mogono ma Siriya u ɓolongi osoji a̱ ni ɗa a kumbai a̱ kanzai likuci i Samariya n kuvon. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Ɗa a yaꞋin kambulu gbani-gbani adama a na likuci ya i geshe ta̱ ukanji, ali e dengei aci njaki azurufa amanga̱na̱shi, kagimi ka kagisamkpatsu ka̱ a̱wiya̱n o moɗoi tankpamu azurufa a tawun. <verse eid="2KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Kanna kete an mogono mi Isaraila wi a nwalu a mashilya ma̱ likuci, ɗa vuka vu yoku vu bankai ni n ma̱shi u danai, &lt;&lt;Ɓa̱nka̱ mu, vuzagbayin va̱ mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Ɗa mogono mu ushuki ma danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u ɓa̱nka̱ wu baci ba, mpa yiɗa̱i mi a kufuɗa kuyaꞋan? Teɗei mi a̱ kuciya̱ ilikulya ko ma̱kya̱n ma na n kuneke wu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Mogono me ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i yi a̱ kuɓa̱la̱ wu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 6:28">Ɗa wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Vuka vu nampa ɗa u danai mu, &lt;Tsu takuma maku ma̱ va̱ anna, kayin ka asa baci ka̱ta̱ tsu kotso ma̱ ni.&gt; <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Ɗa tsu suꞋwain maku ma̱va̱ tsu takumai. Ana kayin ka asai ɗa n danai ni &lt;Tsu una ma̱ ni tsu takuma.&gt; Ɗa u sokongi ma̱ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Ana mogono ma panai nannai ɗa u karai ntogu n ni. A na wi a nwalu a mashilya ma̱ likuci, ɗa uma ene ni na akashi a̱ una̱mgbi u ka̱tsuma. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Mogono ma danai, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan Ka̱shile ka takacika mu ali u laꞋa nannai, ɗa baci n kpa̱ɗa̱i kutakpa kaci ka Ilisha anana, maku ma Shafatu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Ilisha lo a ida̱shi a kpaꞋa ku ni koɓolo nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ mi Isaraila, Ana mogono ma̱ suki vuza vu usuki u reme Ilisha. Ama babu kalingata ka ka yawa, ɗa Ilisha u danai nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma, &lt;&lt;Yi ene ta̱? Tsu na vuza vu ma̱ga̱la̱ka̱ vu nampa u suki vuza u ta̱wa̱ u takpa kaci ka̱ va̱. Ɗa baci vuza vu usuki u yawai, ka̱ta̱ i ɓa̱ya̱ngi punu n tsupulai. Makyan kenu, ci ta̱ a kupana izumgbi i vuzagbayin ni o kutono yi ka̱ca̱pa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Babu Ilisha u kotso kadanshi, ɗa mogono ma yawai ma danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u tukai tsu n atakaci a nampa. Adama yiɗa̱i ɗa n kuvana Vuzavaguɗu kpamu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Ilisha u danai, &lt;&lt;Panai kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu, makpaꞋa a makyan ma nampa i ta̱ a̱ ku denge kiya ku singai kagisamkpatsu kazurufa kete, n agisamkpatsu e re a icuꞋu i bale kazurufa kete a u tsutsu u Samariya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Vuzagbayin vu osoji vuza na wi koɓolo m mogono u danai vuma vu Ka̱shile, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, ko ɗa baci Vuzavaguɗu n ka̱ci ka̱ ni u ɓa̱yuwa̱i utsutsu u gaɗi, ili i nampa yi a kuyaꞋan nanai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 7:2">Ilisha u dana ni, &lt;&lt;Vi ta̱ e kene n a̱shi a̱ nu, vi tana a kulyaꞋa ko i te ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkutu m banai a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka irala i le.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />A yaꞋan ta̱ uma a̱na̱shi, aza a mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu, aza a na ida̱shi u tsutsu u likuci i Samariya. Ɗa a dansai, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ yiɗa̱i tsa ku shamgba punu na ali tsu kuwa̱? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Tsu dana baci, &lt;Ci ta̱ a kuꞋuwa punu a̱ likuci,&gt; Kambulu ki ta̱ a ku una tsu ɗe. Ɗa baci kpamu tsu da̱sa̱ngi punu na ci ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱. Adama nannai tsu bana tsu neke ka̱ci ka̱ tsu a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka aza a Siriya. Ɗa baci a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i tsu n wuma, derere. Ɗa baci tana a unai tsu, ukpa̱ u ɗaɗa ci ishi a kuvana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Ɗa a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i ci na ɗe kanna ka̱ yikpa̱, a banai a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka aza a Siriya. Ana a yawai a̱ ka̱ga̱Ꞌin ka̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka, a cina punu uma ba, <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />adama a na Vuzavaguɗu u zuwa ta̱ aza a Siriya a panai izumgbi adanshi odoku a ɗa n ekeke odoku n ka̱kuma̱ ko osoji kaꞋa ki lo a̱ kuta̱wa̱. Ɗa a dananai, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, mogono mi Isaraila ma banuku ta̱ ngono n Hitiya n ngono n Masar adama a na a lyaꞋa tsu n kuvon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Ɗa a sumai ci na ɗe kanna ka̱ yikpa̱, ɗa a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i a̱pa̱m e le n odoku le n njaki n le, a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i ka̱tsura̱ ka, a sumai adama a na a laꞋaka n wuma.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Ana nkutu n a̱na̱shi ma n yawai a̱ ka̱ga̱Ꞌin ka̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka, ɗa a uwai a̱ ka̱pa̱m ke te a lyaꞋi o soꞋi, ɗa a̱ pura̱i azurufa na azanariya, n akashi, a banai o sokongi. Ɗa o bonoi a uwai a̱ ka̱pa̱m koyoku kpamu, ɗa a̱ pura̱i ucanuku punu, ɗa kpamu o sokongi.<verse eid="2KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Ɗa a dananai, &lt;&lt;Ci yaꞋan mejege ba. Anana kanna ka arabali a singai a ɗa, ɗa baci tsu paɗai bini a kubana usana, atakaci i ta̱ a kufuɗa kuta̱wa̱ tsu, yaꞋan tsu bana tsu dana a kpaꞋa ku mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Ana a yawai ɗevu n utsutsu u likuci ɗa a̱ ɗengusa̱i a̱la̱ka̱tsu a danai aza a kindi, &lt;&lt;Tsu bana ta̱ a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka aza a Siriya ko vuma tsu cina ɗe ba, babu kpamu izumgbi i vuma. Odoku aɗa n njaki koci ushiyishi a̱pa̱m e le, i ta̱ lo tsu na a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Ɗa aza a kindi a salai arabali a, a danai kpaꞋa ku mogono.<verse eid="2KI 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ ɗa̱nga̱i n kayin, u danai a gbashi a̱ ni,&lt;&lt;YaꞋan n dana ɗa̱ ili i na aza a Siriya a yaꞋankai tsu. E yeve ta̱ ci ta̱ n kambulu, ɗaɗa i zuwai ɗa a sumai e sheɗeki a kakamba, i ta̱ kusheshe, &lt;Yi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱ a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ likuci ya, ka̱ta̱ tsu reme le n wuma, ci isa likuci ya.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Vuza vu te punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko nkoshi gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ ma ulinga u n mogono wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;YaꞋan uma o yoku a ɗika odoku a tawun aza a na a buwai, a bana o goɗumo ili i na tsu panai. Ɗa baci a unai le, wo ko okpo ili i yoku ba n a̱ tsu na ci ida̱shi a̱ likuci, adama a na a̱ tsu va feu ukpa̱ u ɗa ci a kuvana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Ɗa a zagbai ekeke odoku e re n odoku e le, ɗa mogono ma̱ suki uma a u danai le, &lt;&lt;Banai i goɗumo ili i na i gita̱i n osoji a Siriya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Ɗa o tonoi le ali a kubana o Kuyene ku Urudu, a cinai akashi n ucanuku u kuvon le uvarukushi a uye ra̱ka̱, u na aza a Siriya a varukushi a makyan ma na i o moloko a suma. Ɗa alingata a o bonoi a danai mogono. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Ɗa uma a̱ likuci i Samariya uta̱i ni ilaɗi a kubana a̱ ka̱tsura̱ ka aza a Siriya a̱ pura̱i ucanuku u gbani. Ɗa e dengei kagisamkpatsu ka kiya kete kazurufa, agisamkpatsu e re a icuꞋu i bali kazurufa feu, tsu na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka danai.<verse eid="2KI 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Vuzagbayin vu osoji vu na mogono ma zuwai wu inda u tsutsu u likuci wa, ɗa ka̱bunda̱i ka uma ka dasa ni ali u kuwa̱i, tsu na Ilisha vuma vu Ka̱shile u danai mogono a na u banai kene yi. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Tsu na kpamu vuma vu Ka̱shile u danai mogono &lt;&lt;MakpaꞋa a makyan ma nampa, i ta̱ e kudenge agisamkpatsu e re a icuꞋu i bali kazurufa, n kagisamkpatsu ka kiya kazurufa feu a̱ u tsutsu u likuci i Samariya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Vuzagbayin vu osoji va wu ushuki vuma vu Ka̱shile a makyan ma nanlo, u danai, &lt;&lt;Ko ɗa baci Vuzavaguɗu u ɓa̱yuwa̱i u tsutsu u gaɗi, ili i nampa ya yi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan nannai?&gt;&gt; Ilisha tana u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vi ta̱ e kene n a̱shi a̱ nu, ama vi tana a kulyaꞋa ili ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Ta tana ili ya i yaꞋin n a̱yi nannai. Uma a ɗa a dasai ni a̱ utsutsu u likuci ali u kuwa̱i.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">O bonokoi vuka vuza va aza a Shunemu ubuta̱ u ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Ilisha u dana ta̱ vuka vuna u bonokoi maku ma̱ ni n wuma, &lt;&lt;Ɗa̱nga̱ vu suma n muku n nu a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u yoku, adama a na Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱wa̱ka̱ n kambulu a iɗika ya ali a̱ya̱ e cindere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Ɗa vuka va vu ɗa̱nga̱i u yaꞋin tsu na vuma vu Ka̱shile va u danai. Ɗa u lazai n aza a kpaꞋa a̱ ni a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a iɗika ya aza a Filisitiya a̱ya̱ e cindere.<verse eid="2KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Ana a̱ya̱ e cindere a lazai, ɗa vuka va vu uta̱i a iɗika i Filisitiya u bonoi. U banai u mogono adama a na o bonoko yi n kpaꞋa ku ni n kashina ka̱ ni. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Mogono a kadanshi n Gehazi, kagbashi ka vuma vu Ka̱shile, u danai, &lt;&lt;Dana mu arabali ili i gbagbain i na Ilisha u yaꞋin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Ana wi a kudana mogono tsu na Ilisha u ɗengusa̱i ka̱kpisa̱, ɗa vuka vu na Ilisha u bonokoi maku ma̱ ni n wuma u uwai n ma̱shi u mogono, ufolu o bonoko yi n kpaꞋa ku ni n kashina ka̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:5">Ɗa Gehazi u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuka vu ɗaɗa na vuzagbayin va̱ mogono, maku ma na Ilisha u bonokoi n wuma u ni a̱yi ɗa na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Ana mogono me ecei vuka va, ɗa tonokoi ni ukuna wa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:6">Ɗa mogono ma zuwai vuza vi te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n kefeku, u danai, &lt;&lt;Bonokoi ni n ili i na yi i ni, n kodokpotsu ki ili i na a kyaꞋi punu a kashina ka ali a kanna ka na u ka̱sukpa̱i iɗika ya a̱ kuta̱wa̱ gogo na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haziyelu wu unai Ben-hadadu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Ilisha u banai Dimaska, a makyan ma na Ben-hadadu mogono ma Siriya wi a̱ mɓa̱la̱. Ci na ɗe a dana mogono, &lt;&lt;Vuma vu Ka̱shile u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱ likuci i nampa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Haziyelu, &lt;&lt;Ɗika kuneꞋe vu bana u vuma vu Ka̱shile. Vu dana yi we ece ke wu Vuzavaguɗu, &lt;Mi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱na̱ a̱ mɓa̱la̱ n va̱?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Haziyelu u banai wi Ilisha n kuneꞋe ku canuku icuꞋu kakau u Dimaska, u na arakuma amangere a ɗikai. Ana u yawai ɗa u shamgbai e kelime ki Ilisha ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Maku ma̱ nu Ben-hadadu mogono ma Siriya ma a u suku mu me ece wu, &lt;Ko wi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱na̱ a̱ mɓa̱la̱ n ni?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Ilisha wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Bana vu dana yi, &lt;Mayun wi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱na̱,&gt; Ama Vuzavaguɗu u yotsongu mu ta̱ wi a kulaꞋa ba wi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Ilisha u ka̱na̱i kinda Haziyelu, ali Haziyelu u panai wono. Ɗa vuma vu Ka̱shile va u ɓosoi n ma̱shi.<verse eid="2KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Haziyelu we ecei,&lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i zuwai vuzagbayin va̱ ma̱shi?&gt;&gt; Ilisha wu ushuki u danai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:12">&lt;&lt;Adama a na n yeve ta̱ kawuya ka na vi a kuyaꞋanka aza a Isaraila. Vi ta̱ o ku songu likuci yi nshilya n le, ka̱ta̱ vu una muku mo olobo ele n kotokobi, vi ta̱ kpamu a kuɓasangu aci a̱ muku n le a iɗika, ka̱ta̱ kpamu vu ka̱rukpa̱sa̱ a̱ ma̱ci le aza a̱tsuma̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Ɗa Haziyelu u danai, &lt;&lt;Niniɗai kagbashi ka̱ nu ka kufuɗa kuyaꞋan ili i gbayin i nampa, mpa mesheꞋe,&gt;&gt; Ɗa Ilisha u dana ni,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:13">&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu u yotsongu mu ta̱ vi ta̱ o ko okpo mogono ma Siriya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Ana Haziyelu u bonoi ɗa Ben-hadadu we ecei ni, u danai, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i Ilisha u danai ni nu?&gt;&gt; Haziyelu u danai, &lt;&lt;U dana mu ta̱ mayun vi ta̱ a̱ kuta̱na̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Ama a na kayin kasai ɗa Haziyelu u ɗikai ogbodo u yeki a̱ mini ɗa u palai a̱shi o mogono, ali u kuwa̱i. Ɗa Haziyelu wo okpoi mogono ma Siriya a̱ una̱ u Ben-hadadu,<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoram mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka tawun ko tsugono tsu Joram maku ma Ahabu mogono mi Isaraila, ɗa Jehoram maku ma Johoshafatu mogono ma Yahuda u gita̱i tsugono. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Jehoram n a̱ya̱ kamangankupa n e re ana wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ kunla̱i. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Jehoram u tonoi uye u mogono mi Isaraila tsu na kpaꞋa ku Ahabu ku yaꞋin, adama a na u zuwa ta̱ mekere ma Ahabu. U yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu u ciga ku una iɗika i Yahuda ba, adama a na u yaꞋan ta̱ uzuwakpani n Dawuda, u danai, ntsukaya n ni mi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa kelime n kulyaꞋa tsugono.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />A ayin a na Jehoram wi a kulyaꞋa tsugono a iɗika i Yahuda, ɗa aza a Edom a yaꞋankai ni ugbamiwasuvu ɗa a zuwai mogono me le. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Ɗa Jehoram wu uta̱i n ekeke odoku a̱ ni u banai a̱ likuci i Jayiru. Ɗa aza a Edom a̱ kanza ni n akumbi ekeke odoku a̱ ni, ama ɗa Jehoram u lapai le n kayin, ɗa osoji a̱ ni a sumai o kubono a i uwa i le. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Ta aza a Edom i a kuyaꞋanka aza a Yahuda ugbamiwasuvu nannai ali n anana. A makyan me te maꞋa likuci i Libina feu i yaꞋankai aza a Yahuda ugbamiwasuvu.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jehoram n ili i na u yaꞋin ra̱ka̱ yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Ɗa Jehoram u bankai ukpisa̱ ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngini koɓolon ni ikaya i ni a̱ likuci i Dawuda. Ɗa Ahaziya maku ma̱ ni wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n ka ire ko tsugono tsu Joram maku ma Ahabu mogono mi Isaraila, Ahaziya maku Jehoram mogono ma Yahuda u gita̱i tsugono. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahaziya wi ta̱ na̱ a̱ya̱ kamanga n e re a na wo okpoi mogono. U lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima ka̱ya̱ ke te. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa Ataliya, a̱yi vashi vu Omiri mogono mi Isaraila maꞋa. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Ana wo okpoi Ahaziya u zuwai mekere ma Ahabu, ɗa u tonoi uye u gbani-gbani u kpaꞋa ku Ahabu.U yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Ahaziya u gbaɓai kaci n Jehoram maku ma Ahabu a banai kuyaꞋan kuvon n Haziyelu mogono ma Siriya. A Ramotu-giliyadu, ɗa aza a Siriya a yaꞋankai Joram usa̱n. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Ɗa mogono Joram u bonoi a̱ likuci i Jezirelu, adama a na a̱ la̱na̱ yi untsu a̱ ni a na aza a Siriya a yaꞋankai ni a Ramotu, a na u banai kuyaꞋan kuvon n mogono Haziyelu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 8:29">Ɗa mogono Ahaziya maku ma Jehoram mogono ma Yahuda u banai adama a na u kya̱sa̱ yi, a na a uka ni usa̱n.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">A zagbai Jehu wo okpoi mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Ilisha keneki u ɗekei vuma vu te a̱ ka̱tsuma ke eneki u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Foɓuso, vu shiya motogu ma̱ nu n kaɗambura, vu ɗika kedele ka maniꞋin ma zaitu a̱ kukiye ku nu, vu bana a Ramotu-giliyadu. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Ɗa baci vu yawai ɗe, ka̱ta̱ vu la̱nsa̱ Jehu maku ma Jehoshafatu vashi vu Nimshi. Vu zuwa yi u ɗa̱nga̱ a uɓon wa̱ a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ ni ka̱ta̱ vu uka yi a̱ kunu ka asuvu. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Ka̱ta̱ vu ɗika kedele ka maniꞋin ma zaitu ma vu tsunki a kaci, ka̱ta̱ vu dana, &lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗanna, m zagba wu ta̱ mogono mi Isaraila.&gt; Ka̱ta̱ vu ɓa̱yuwa̱ utsutsu vu suma, ka̱ta̱ vu geshe ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Ɗa kolobo ka, a̱yi na wi keneki ka, u yaꞋain tsu na a danai ni, u banai a Ramotu-giliyadu.<verse eid="2KI 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Ana u yawai ɗe, ɗa u cinai ovonshi o osoji a̱ ida̱shi a̱ ubuta̱ ute. Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Mi ta̱ n akaka a̱ nu Kovonshi.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Jehu we ecei,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">&lt;&lt;Akaka a yayi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ tsu?&gt;&gt; Ɗa wu ushuki udanai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:5">&lt;&lt;Akaka a̱ nu, Kovonshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Ɗa Jehu u ɗa̱nga̱i, a uwai a kpaꞋa. Ɗa keneki ka ka̱ tsunki Jehu maniꞋin a kaci,&lt;&lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu, Ka̱shile ki Israila ka danai, m zagba wu ta̱ mogono mi Isaraila uma a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Avu ɗa va kuna kpaꞋa ku Ahabu vuzagbayin nu, adama a na n takacika Jezebelu adama a mpasa n eneki n kagimi ka agbashi a na wu unai. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />KpaꞋa ku Ahabu ki ta̱ a kuyaꞋan wuni ra̱ka̱, mi ta̱ a ku una maku mo kolobo dem, vuza gbani ko kagbashi. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Mi ta̱ a kuzuwa kpaꞋa ku Ahabu ko okpo an kpaꞋa ku Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu, n kpaꞋa ku Basha maku ma Ahija. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Jezebelu tamkpamu nsheꞋe n ɗa n kutakuma inyama i ni a kapashi ka Jezirelu, babu tana vuza na u kuciɗa̱ngu yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗa keneki ka ka̱ ɓa̱yuwa̱i utsutsu wu uta̱i u sumai. <verse eid="2KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Ana Jehu wu uta̱i a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ aza a̱ ni osoji, ɗa ecei ni a danai, &lt;&lt;Nini ɗai gbaga ɗa ko? Yiɗa̱i i tuka̱i kajarishi ka nampa wa̱ a̱nu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:11">Jehu wu ushuki le u danai, &lt;&lt;I yeve ta̱ vicuꞋu vu vuma va n ili i na u tsu dansa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Ɗa a danai, &lt;&lt;Mayun ɗa ba, dana tsu ili i na u danai nu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:12">Ɗa Jehu u danai le, &lt;&lt;Vuma va u dana mu ta̱, &lt;Vuzavaguɗu u danai, n zagba wu ta̱ vu okpo mogono mi Isaraila.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Gogo lo, ɗa o foɗoi aminya a gbagbain ele, o poloi a iɗika adama a na Jehu u dasa zuva. Ɗa a̱ lika̱i kavana n orukpoi, &lt;&lt;Jehu ɗa mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehu wu unai Joram n Ahaziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Jehu maku ma Jehoshafatu vashi vu Nimshi, u yaꞋin nsata tsu na a ku una Joram mogono. Makyan ma nanlo tana Joram ɗe n osoji a Ramotu-giliyadu ele a kinda iɗika yi Isaraila a kpadai Haziyelu mogono ma Siriya <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />Ama makyan ma nanlo wana ɗai Joram mogono u bono u Jezirelu, a̱ la̱na̱ usa̱n una aza a Siriya a uka ni a̱ ubuta̱ u kuvon. Ɗa Jehu u danai osoji, &lt;&lt;Ɗa baci i cigai mu mo okpo mogono, ka̱ta̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ vuza wu uta̱ a̱ likuci u bana u Jezirelu u dana arabali a ili i na ci yaꞋin ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Ɗa Jehu u foɓusoi keke vu odoku o kuvon a̱ ni u kumbai a kubana u Jezirelu, a̱ ubuta̱ u na Joram wi a ivaꞋin. Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda feu cina u bana kula̱na̱ vuza vu usa̱n Joram.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Ana vuza kindi ku mashilya ma Jezirelu, we enei Jehu n uma a̱ ni a̱ kuta̱wa̱, ɗa u salakai Joram, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ uma a̱ kuta̱wa̱ n e keke odoku.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:17">Joram mogono u danai, &lt;&lt;Suku kakumbi ko odoku u bana we ece le, &lt;I ta̱wa̱ ta̱ m ma̱ta̱na̱?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Kakumbi ko kodoku ka u banai u gasai n Jehu u danai, &lt;&lt;Mogono ma ciga ta̱ me yeve, &lt;M ma̱ta̱na̱ maꞋa vu ta̱wa̱i?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Jehu wu ushuki. &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i burai nu m ma̱ta̱na̱? Tono mu ka̱ca̱pa̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:18">Ɗa vuza kindi va u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;Kalingata ka na i suki u gasa ne le va, u bono ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ suki kakumbi ko odoku ka i re u banai u danai le. &lt;&lt;Mogono ma ciga ta̱ me yeve &lt;M ma̱ta̱na̱ maꞋa i ta̱wa̱i?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:19">Jehu wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i i burai nu m ma̱ta̱na̱? Tono mu ka̱ca̱pa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Ɗa vuza kindi va u doku u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuza vu i re vu na vu suki va u cina le ta̱ ama wi o kubono feu ba. Nwalu ma mi ta̱ an nwalu n Jehu maku Nimshi, adama a na wi ta̱ nwalu tsu kajarishi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Joram mogono me nekei kadanshi, u danai, &lt;&lt;Foɓusokoi mu keke vo odoku va̱,&gt;&gt; Ɗa Joram mogono mi Isaraila n Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda a̱ ɗa̱nga̱i, e keke odoku le a kubana kugasa n Jehu. Ɗa a cina ni a ka̱pula̱ka̱ ka Nabot vuza va aza a Jezirelu.<verse eid="2KI 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Ana Joram wu enei Jehu, ɗa u we ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Vu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ m ma̱ta̱na̱? Jehu wu ushuki u danai,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:22">&lt;&lt;Nini ɗai wo ko okpo ma̱ta̱na̱? A na a̱na̱ku a̱nu Jezebelu u tuka̱i tsu nu nkunu n kagbanigbani a̱ ubuta̱ dem?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Joram u kpatalai n kodoku ka̱ ni u sumai, e kuɗeke Ahaziya, &lt;&lt;Na lo kagbanigbani kaꞋa Ahaziya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Ɗa Jehu u ronoi utan u tawai Joram e mere ma̱ kucina̱ n kaya ɗa ka uwai ali a̱ ka̱ɗu. Ɗa u yikpa̱i e keke vu odoku vi ni. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Jehu u danai Bidikaru kagbashi ka̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Ɗika yi vu taɗuku yi ka̱pula̱ka̱ ka Nabot vuza aza a Jezirelu. Ko vu ciɓa ta̱ n kanna ka na mpa n avu ci an nwalu koɓolon Ahabu esheku a̱ ni, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kene ku wuya adama a̱ ni? <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />&lt;Mayun na̱yi mene ta̱ mpasa n Nabot n mpasa n maku ma̱ ni, Vuzavaguɗu u danai, N kucina ta̱ mi ta̱ a kutsupaka yi a vu yaꞋin a ka̱pula̱ka̱ ka nampa.&gt; Adama nanai ɗika yi vu taɗuku yi punu a ka̱pula̱ka̱ ka Nabot ka tsu na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka danai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Ana Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda we enei ili i na i gita̱i, ɗa u sumai u tonoi uye a kubana Betu-hagan. Ɗa Jehu u guvai ni, n u danai, &lt;&lt;Una ni feu.&gt;&gt;Ɗa a uka ni usa̱n punu e keke vo odoku vi ni a̱yi a kukumba kaginda ka Guru, kana ki ɗevu n Ibileyam. Ɗa u sumai a kubana a Magido u kuwa̱i ɗe. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Agbashi a̱ ni a ɗika ni e keke vu odoku o kuvon a kubana a Urushelima, a̱ ciɗa̱ngini a kasaun ka̱ ni koɓolo n ikaya i ni a̱ likuci i Dawuda. <verse eid="2KI 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n kete ka tsugono tsu Joram maku ma Ahabu, Ahaziya wo okpoi mogono ma Yahuda.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpa̱ u Jezebelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Ana Jehu u ta̱wa̱i a Jezirelu, ɗa Jezebelu u panai kaꞋa, ɗa u lapulai a̱shi a̱ ni n isukumushi, ɗa lapulai ka̱nji ka̱ ni, ɗa u la̱nuki n katusu ka̱ kunu. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Ana Jehu u uwai utsutsu u kefeku, ɗa Jezebelu we ecei ni &lt;&lt;Vu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ m ma̱ta̱na̱ ko vuza vu ma̱ga̱la̱ka̱? Vi ta̱ tsu Zimiri vuza na wu unai vuzagbayin vi ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Ana Jehu u ɗa̱ngusa̱i a̱shi a̱ ni ɗa we enei ni ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Yayi wi a̱ kucina̱ kuva̱?&gt;&gt; Ko vuza yoku wi ta̱ lo? Ɗa ndari n ni n re ko n tatsu indanai ni. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Jehu u danai le, &lt;&lt;Taɗuku ni a iɗika.&gt;&gt; Ɗa tana a taku ni n katusu ka̱ kunu ka. Mpasa n ni n tsuwa̱in a̱ ubuta̱ dem a kasaka n ikyamba yo odoku. Ɗa Jehu u zuwai odoku a dasai ni.<verse eid="2KI 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Ɗa Jehu u uwai a kefeku ko mogono u lyai u soꞋi. Ana u yaꞋin nannai ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Banai i ciɗa̱ngu vuka vu una̱ u wuya va, adama a na mekere mo mogono maꞋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Ana a banai kuciɗa̱ngu vuka va, moko ma kaci maꞋa a cinai n ene ne ekiye koci. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Ɗa o bonoi a danai Jehu, ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka shana ta̱ ka na ka̱ uta̱i una̱ u Iliya vuza va aza a Tishibi, &lt;A uɓon u Jezirelu u ɗa nsheꞋe n kutakuma inyama i Jezebelu. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Ikyamba i Jezebelu yi ta̱ o ko okpo tsuta̱ a na a̱wiya̱n nnama punu a kakamba ka Jezirelu, tsuna babu vuza na u kufuɗa kudana, Jezebelu ɗa na va.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Jehu wu unai aza a kpaꞋa ku Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Muku n Ahabu aza a na ida̱shi a Samariya uma amangatatsu n kupa. Ɗa Jehu u ɗanai atagarda akaka u suki n aɗa a kubana a Samariya, n aza o tsugono tsu Jezirelu, n nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱, n aza a na i a kinda muku n Ahabu. U danai, <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />&lt;&lt;Ɗa baci yi isai atagarda akaka a nampa, muku n mogono mi ta̱ ekiye a̱ ɗa̱, yi ta̱ kpamu n ekeke odoku o kuvon, n likuci yi nshilya n ucanuku u kuvon, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />Ka̱ta̱ i zagba vuza na u yotsoi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ muku n mogono ma, i zuwa yi u da̱sa̱ngu a kakuba ko tsugono ke esheku a̱ ni. Ka̱ta̱ yi uta̱ i yaꞋan vishili adama a kpaꞋa ku vuzagbayin ɗa̱ Ahabu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Ama ɗa wovon u ka̱na̱i le, ɗa a danai, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱, ngono n re n fuɗa baci n shilika̱i n Jehu ba. Yiɗa̱i a̱tsu tsa kufuɗa kuyaꞋan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Ɗa vuza vu kelime vu ku kpaꞋa ku mogono, n vuza kelime vu likuci va, n nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n aza a na i a kinda muku n mogono, a̱ suki akaka a kubana u Jehu, a danai. &lt;&lt;A̱tsu agbashi a̱ nu aɗa, ci ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ili i na baci vu danai tsu ci yaꞋan. Ci a kuzagba vuza yoku mogono ba, yaꞋan ili i na ve enei i laꞋi n kugaꞋan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Ɗa Jehu u doku u ɗanakai le katagarda ka akaka ka ire, u danai, &lt;&lt;Yi baci a̱ kucina̱ ku va̱, kpamu yi o kutono mu, tuka̱i mu n aci a̱ maku n kpaꞋa ku mogono vuzagbayin ɗa̱ a Jezirelu makpa a makyan ma nampa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:6">Muku n mogono amangatatsu n kupa, i ta̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza e kelime ka̱ likuci ya, aza a na i a̱ kuɓa̱na̱ le. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Ana katagarda ka yawai ekiye le, ɗa e remei muku amangatatsu n kupa a, a kiɗai ɗa a zuwai aci a a mabana. A̱ suꞋuki mogono n aɗa a Jezirelu. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Ana vuza vu usuki u kayawai, ɗa u danai Jehu,&lt;&lt;A̱ tuka̱ ta̱ n aci a̱ muku n mogono ma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:8">Ɗa Jehu u danai, &lt;&lt;Ɓolongi le oɓolo e re, ka̱ta̱ i zuwa aɗa utsutsu u likuci, i ka̱sukpa̱ le lo ali kayin ka asa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />N usana a na Jehu wu uta̱i a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u na uma i o ɓolongi a kinda aci, ɗa u danai le, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗa̱ kabura ɗa̱ ba mpaɗa vuza na n yaꞋin nsata n na a unai mogono vuzagbayin va̱, ama gogo na yayi wu unai ele na ra̱ka̱? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Vu yeve, kadanshi ka na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin adama kpaꞋa ku Ahabu ki ta̱ a kushana. Vuzavaguɗu u shatangu ta̱ ili i na yi uta̱i una̱ u kagbashi ka̱ ni Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Ɗa Jehu wu unai kagimi ka uma ka kpaꞋa ku Ahabu ra̱ka̱, n kumaci ku ni, aza a na i a ida̱shi a Jezirelu, aza a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n a̱ja̱Ꞌa̱ a̱ ni n anan ganu dem. Ta u ka̱sukpa̱i Ahabu nannai ko vuma vite.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Jehu u lazai a kubana a Samariya. A̱yi a Betu-ekedu vu nguɓi, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />Ɗa u gasai n kumaci ku Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda. Ɗa we cei le, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗa̱ anan yayi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:13">Ɗa ushuki, &lt;&lt;A̱tsu aza a kpaꞋa ku Ahaziya aɗa. Ci ta̱ a kubana ikya̱shi i muku n Ahabu mogono n muku n Jezebelu Egbere.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Jehu u danai uma a̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Remei le n wuma,&gt;&gt; Ɗa e remei le ra̱ka̱ n wuma uma amangere n e re ɗa a kiɗai le a kayinva ka Betu-ekedu. Babu vuza na u laꞋi. <verse eid="2KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Ana Jehu u ka̱sukpa̱ ubuta̱ wa, ɗa u gasai n Jehonadabu maku ma Rekabu, a̱yi uye a kubana kene yi. Ana a̱ kya̱sa̱na̱i, ɗa Jehu u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Vu ɗika mu ta̱ a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱ nu tsu na mpa n ɗikai nu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Jehonadabu wu ushuki u danai,&lt;&lt;E, n ɗika wu ta̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 10:15">Jehu u danai, &lt;&lt;Ta baci nannai, neke mu kukiye ku nu.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u nekei Jehu kukiye ku ni. Ɗa Jehu u ronoi ni kukiye u kumbakai ni ekeke vu odoku vi ni.<verse eid="2KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Ɗa Jehu u danai, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ koɓolo nu mpa, ve ene tsu na n zuwai ka̱ɗu ka̱va̱ u Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Jehonadabu u tonoi ni ekeke vu odoku vi ni. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Ana Jehu u yawai a Samariya, ɗa wu unai aza a na a buwai a kpaꞋa ku Ahabu, tsu na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka̱ uta̱i una̱ u Iliya.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehu wu unai ganu vu Balu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Ɗa Jehu u ɓolongi uma a Samariya u danai le, &lt;&lt;Ahabu u ga̱nda̱ka̱ ta̱ Balu kenu, ama Jehu wi ta̱ a̱ ku ga̱nda̱ka̱ yi ka̱u. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Ɗekushekei mu eneki a Balu, n aza a ulinga a̱ni koɓolo n anan ganu a̱ ni. Ka̱ta̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ ko vuma vu te u kpa̱ɗa̱ kuta̱wa̱ ba, mi ta̱ n alyuka a gbayin a na mi a kuyaꞋanka Balu. Vuza na baci u ta̱wa̱i ba mi ta̱ a kuna yi.&gt;&gt; Ama Jehu ugboji u ɗa wi a kuyaꞋanka le adama a na wu una aza a na o kutono Balu.<verse eid="2KI 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Ɗa Jehu u danai, &lt;&lt;Zuwai kanna ka na a kucikpa Balu.&gt;&gt; Ɗa a zuwai kanna. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Jehu u suki akaka a̱ ubuta̱ ra̱ka̱ a iɗika yi Isaraila u banuki uma a na o kutono Balu a̱ ta̱wa̱, ɗa ra̱ka̱ vi le a̱ ta̱wa̱i, babu vuza na u kpa̱ɗa̱i kuta̱wa̱, ali ɗa a shatangi kpaꞋa ku Balu tukpa. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Jehu u danai vuza vu ulinga wa akashi a ciɗa, &lt;&lt;Neke uma a na i o kutono Balu a uka.&gt;&gt; Ɗa vuma va tana u nekei le a ukai.<verse eid="2KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Ɗa Jehu u banai a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Balu a koɓolon Jehonadabu maku ma Rekabu. Jehu u danai aza a na i o kutono Balu, &lt;&lt;La̱na̱i mayin, adama a na ka̱ta̱ a̱ ciya̱ vuza na wi o kutono Vuzavaguɗu punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ko otoni a Balu ba, sai otoni a Balu koci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Ɗa a uwai punu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a ra̱ka̱ adama a na a yaꞋan alyuka n kuneꞋe ku kusongu a kubana u Balu. Cina tana Jehu u zuwa uma amanga̱na̱shi pulai, u danai le vuza na baci u ka̱sukpa̱i vuza te u lazai, wi ta̱ a kutsupa m wuma uni.<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Gogo lo ana u kotsoi kuneꞋe ku kusongu, ɗa u danai aza a kindi n aza e kelime osoji, &lt;&lt;Uwai punu yi una le ra̱ka̱, ka̱ta̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ ko vuza te u laꞋa ba.&gt;&gt; Ɗa a unai le ra̱ka̱ n kotokobi, ɗa aza a kindi a n osoji o ronoi i kyamba i le na a taɗuki pulai. Ɗa uma a Jehu a uwai punu asuvu a a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Balu. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Ɗa a uta̱ka̱i katali ka̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ ka Balu pulai o osongi kaꞋa. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Ɗa o ɓosoi katali ka ubuta̱ u ciɗa u Balu ɗa kpamu o ɓosoi a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Balu, ɗa uma o bonukoi ubuta̱ wa ubuta̱ kukofongu ali n anna.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Ta Jehu u zuwai a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kucikpa Balu nanai a Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Ama Jehu u ka̱sukpa̱ kuyaꞋan unushi u na Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu ma yaꞋin ba, a na u zuwai aza a Isaraila kuyaꞋan unushi tsu na a cikpai ndendem ma azanariya e Betelu, n Dan.<verse eid="2KI 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u danai Jehu, adama a na vu yaꞋin ta̱ ili i na yi mejege a̱ a̱shi a̱va̱, ɗa kpamu vi yaꞋankai kpaꞋa ku Ahabu ili i na yi a̱ ka̱ɗu ka̱va̱, an mi a kuciga kuyaꞋan, adama a nannai ntsukaya n nu mi ta̱ a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu a kakuba ko tsugono ci Isaraila ali tsukaya tsu na̱shi. <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Ama Jehu u tono wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka Isaraila n ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ra̱ka̱ ba. U ka̱sukpa̱ kuyaꞋan unushi u na Jerobuwam u zuwai Isaraila a yaꞋin ba.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Ayin a nanlo, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u gita̱i kujebe a̱bunda̱i ki Isaraila. Haziyelu mogono ma Siriya ma lyaꞋi ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱i wi Isaraila n kuvon. <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />Ili i na i ɗikai a kasana ka Kuyene ku Urudu, iɗika i Giliyadu n Gatu, n aza a Ruben, n aza a Manasa, i na i ɗikai a̱ likuci i Arowa n ka̱ɗa̱ka̱i ka kuyene ku Aruno ɗaɗa Giliyadu n Bashan.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jehu n ili i na uyaꞋin, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Ana Jehu u bankai ukpisa̱, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngini a Samariya. Ɗa Jehowahazu maku ma̱ ni mo okpoi mogono una̱ u ni <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Jehu u lyai tsugono ci Isaraila a Samariya a̱ya̱ kamanga n kunla̱i.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">egbere Ataliya u lyaꞋi tsugono a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Ana Ataliya, a̱na̱ku a Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda, we enei maku ma̱ ni ukpa̱, ɗa u gita̱i kuna muku n kpaꞋa ku mogono. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Ama Jehosheba mekere ma Joram mogono, u ɗikai Jowashi maku ma Ahaziya u sumai n a̱yi, a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ muku n mogono ma vuza na ishi a kuna. U sokongi ni koɓolo n vuza na wi o kuwoꞋo yi a̱ kunu ka asuvu. Ta u lakai e kiye a Ataliya nannai u kpa̱ɗa̱i kuciya̱ kuna yi <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Jowashi u yongoi usokongi a̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu ali a̱ya̱ a̱ta̱li, a makyan ma na Ataliya wi o tsugono ci iɗika ya.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ cindere ka̱ tsugono tsu Ataliya, Jehoyida ganu u zuwai e ɗekei osoji aza a kindi ku mogono, n aza a kindi ku kpaꞋa ku mogono a̱ ta̱wa̱ wa̱ ni a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. Ɗa u zuwai le a yaꞋin uzuwakpani n akucina punu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu i ta̱ o kutono yi. Ɗa u yotsonki le Jowashi maku ma Ahaziya mogono. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Jehoyida u danai le, &lt;&lt;Na ɗa ili i na i kuyaꞋan. Kanna ka na baci yi a kubana ulinga na Ashibi ka̱ta̱ i pece ugboku u tatsu, ute a kinda kefeku ko mogono, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />ugboku u re a kinda utsutsu u Sur, ugboku u tatsu tamkpan a shamgba ka̱ca̱pa̱ ko osoji a na i a kinda kpaꞋa ku mogono. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Ugboku u re u na wi a kuvuka a kanna ka Ashibi, i ta̱ a kushamgba inda mogono n a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />I kuka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ mogono, vuma dem u ɓa̱na̱ ucanuku u kuvon ekiye a̱ ni, yi una vuza na baci u cigai kuꞋuwa an we pece ɗa̱. I tono mogono a̱ ubuta̱ u na wa kubana dem.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Ovonshi osoji a yaꞋin tsu na Jehoyida ganu u danai. Kovonshi vo osoji dem u ta̱wa̱ n uma a̱ ni aza a na a kuvuka a kanna ka Ashibi, n aza a na a̱ kugita̱ ulinga kanna ka Ashibi. Ra̱ka̱ vi le a̱ ta̱wa̱i u Jehoyida ganu. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Ɗa u nekei kovonshi dem masara nu nra̱ga̱ n na mi ishi n Dawuda mogono, a na u zuwai a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Aza kindi a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi mogono, yaba dem n ucanuku u kuvon u ni e kukiye. E gerei ka̱ci ka̱ le a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi mogono ili i na i ɗikai a uɓon u gaɗi a kubana a uɓon u ɗakai a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌi katalikalyuka.<verse eid="2KI 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Ɗa Jehoyida wu uta̱ka̱i n Jowashi, maku mo mogono, ɗa u ukai ni oroliko a kaci ka̱ ni. Ɗa u nekei Jowashi katagarda ka̱ wila̱ ko tsugono. Ɗa kpamu tsunki ni maniꞋin me kerengu wo okpoi mogono. Ɗa uma a ɓasai ekiye le a danai, &lt;&lt;Wuma u nu u geshe mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Ana egbere Ataliya u panai kacaꞋa ko osoji a na i a kindi n kacaꞋa ka uma, ɗa wu uta̱i u banai a̱ ubuta̱ u uma wa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Ana u yawai, ɗa we enei mogono masavu kashani a̱ ubuta̱ u tsugbayin u ni ɗevu n kashamkpatsu, tsu na ka̱ɗiva̱ ka kuzagba mogono ki. Ovonshi osoji n aza kulika̱ igbala kashani ɗevu n mogono ma, n uma a iɗika ya a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ n lika̱i igbala ka̱u. Ɗa Ataliya u karai aminya a̱ ni ɗa u ɓosoi ka̱da̱wuri u danai, &lt;&lt;Ugbamiwasuvu, ugbamiwasuvu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Ɗa Jehoyida ganu u danai ovonshi osoji, &lt;&lt;Uta̱ka̱ ni pulai e mere mo osoji, ka̱ta̱ yi una yi n kotokobi n vuza na u banai ku isa yi dem.&gt;&gt; Adama a na Ganu va u dana ta̱,&lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ a unai punu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />A ɗikai ni ɗa o tonoi n a̱yi a̱ utsutsu u na odoku a tsu uwaka a kpaꞋa ku mogono, ta ɗe a una ni.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Ɗa Jehoyida u yaꞋin uzuwakpani n Vuzavaguɗu n mogono koɓolo n uma, a danai, i ta̱ o ku okpo uma a Vuzavaguɗu. Ɗa kpamu u yaꞋin uzuwakpani n mogono n uma. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Ɗa uma a iɗika ya ra̱ka̱ a banai a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Balu, o ɓosoi a ɗa. Ɗa o ɓosoi katalikalyuka n a̱ma̱li a̱ ni miri-miri. Ɗa a unai Matan ganu vu Balu e kelime ka katalikalyuka ka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 11:18">Ɗa Jehoyida ganu u zuwai aza a kindi a inda a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Ɗa u ɗikai ovonshi osoji n aza a kindi ku mogono n kpaꞋa ku mogono, n uma a iɗika ya ra̱ka̱, o soki mogono Jowashi ili i na i ɗikai a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu a kubana a kpaꞋa ku mogono. A ukai n mogono utsutsu wa aza kindi a kubana a kpaꞋa ku ni. Ɗa mogono ma kumbai kakuba ko tsugono u da̱sa̱ngi. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Ɗa uma a iɗika ya a yaꞋin ma̱za̱nga̱. Likuci ya feu kpamu i ciya̱i ma̱ta̱na̱, a na a unai Ataliya n kotokobi a kpaꞋa ku mogono. <verse eid="2KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Jowashi n a̱ya̱ e cindere a na wo okpoi mogono ma Yahuda.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Jowashi u lapulai A̱Ꞌisa̱ a Gbayin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ke cindere ko tsugono tsu Jehu, Jowashi u gita̱i tsugono ci iɗika i Yahuda. Ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ amangere. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa̱ Zibiya, a̱ likuci i Biyasheba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Jowashi u yaꞋan ta̱ ili i na yi mejege a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu, adama a na Jehoyida ganu u piꞋisaka yi ta̱ tsu na u kuyaꞋan. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Ama n nannai dem, u ɓoso iꞋuwa ya̱ a̱ma̱li a ba, uma tana a lyai kelime n kubana ɗe na yaꞋin kuneꞋe ku kusongu n ili ma̱gula̱ni a̱ ubuta̱ wa.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Jowashi u danai anan ganu, &lt;&lt;Isai ikebe i na a̱ tukai tsu kuneꞋe ku ciɗa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, n ikebe i na yi isai a̱ ubuta̱ u mekecu n ikebe i na yi isai wa aza a na a yaꞋin uzuwakpani, n ikebe i na uma a̱ tukai n kuneꞋe ku ucigi wa̱ a̱ɗu e le. <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />Ka̱ta̱ ganu dem u ɗika punu a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ki ikebe i na a isai ekiye a uma, u tsupa i na baci a lapulai a kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Ama ali a kubana a̱ya̱ kamanga na tatsu o tsugono tsu Jowashi, anan ganu a fuɗa a lapula kpaꞋa ku Vuzavaguɗu ka ba. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Ɗa Jowashi mogono u ɗekei Jehoyida ganu n anan ganu a na a buwai, u danai le, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ yiɗa̱i ɗa i kpa̱ɗa̱i kulapula a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu? Gogo na ka̱ta̱ i doku yi isa ikebe adama ka̱ci ka̱ ɗa̱ ba. I neke ikebe ya adama kulapula a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Ɗa anan ganu ushuki o kudoku ki isa ikebe ekiye a uma ba, ɗa kpamu ushuki i ta̱ a̱ ku ka̱sukpa̱ uma o yoku feu a yaꞋan ulinga u kulapula a̱Ꞌisa̱.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Ɗa Jehoyida ganu u ɗikai akpati ɗa ta̱sa̱i ka̱kuya̱mkpa̱tsu ka, u zuwai a ɗa e kukiye ku usingai ku katalikalyuka a̱ utsutsu wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. Anan ganu a na i a kinda utsutsu wa, a zuwai ikebe i na uma a̱ tuka̱i ra̱ka̱ punu a akpati va. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Ayin a na baci enei ikebe ya i yimkpa ta̱ punu akpati va, ka̱ta̱ kaɗani ko mogono n ganu vu gbayin a̱ ta̱wa̱ e kece ikebe ya i na a̱ tuka̱i a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu ka̱ta̱ a zuwa i ɗa ujika. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Ka̱ta̱ e neke ikebe ya wa aza a na a zuwai a̱ la̱na̱ ulinga wa, aza a na a tsu tsupa uma a na i ulinga wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, n aza ulinga u kumaꞋa n esheꞋwi a nɗanga, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />AmaꞋin, n aza kusheꞋwe atali. I ta̱ ulinga n ikebe ya adama a na tsula nɗanga n atali a na e sheꞋwei adama a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavagɗu, ka̱ta̱ kpamu a tsupa ulinga u na u buwai a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="2KI 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Ikebe i na a̱ tuka̱i a̱Ꞌisa̱ a, a una i ɗa a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋanka asasu azurufa ba, ko tana ikima̱tsu yi nkuni ba, na nsasu, n ishiyaun ba, ko ucanuku u yoku wa azanariya n azurufa adama a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu ba. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />E neke ta̱ ikebe ya adama a na a tsupa aza ulinga a kulapula a̱Ꞌisa̱ a. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />A zuwa aza a kula̱na̱ ulinga wa a̱ tuka̱ n mekecu mi ikebe i na a unai adama ku lapula a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu ba, adama a na a yaꞋan ta̱ ili yi usuɓi. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Ikebe i na e nekei adama e kuneꞋe ku kutakpa unushi n kuneꞋe ku kucinukpa unushi a̱ tuka̱ n i ɗa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu ba. I nanlo i anan ganu i ɗa.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Makyan ma nanlo, Haziyelu mogono ma Siriya u banai u yaꞋin kuvon n likuci Gatu, u lyai le. Ɗa u kpatalai a kubana kuyaꞋan kuvon n Urushelima, <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Jowashi mogono ma Yahuda u pura̱i ucanuku u ciɗa u na ikaya i ni Jehoshafatu, Joram n Ahaziya, ngono n cau n Yahuda, e nekei Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa u ɓolongi n ili i na a̱yi u nekei Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa u suꞋuki Haziyelu u ɗa ra̱ka̱, koɓolo n azanariya a na i uzuwi a̱ kunu ku kuzuwa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu n kpaꞋa ku mogono. Ɗa mogono Haziyelu u ka̱sukpa̱i Urushelima.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jowashi, n ili i na u yaꞋin yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ka ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Ɗa aza a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ o yoku a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza ulinga a̱ ni a yaꞋin nsata, ɗa unai Jowashi a Betu-milo a uye u na u banai a Sila. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Aza a na a una ni ele ɗa, Jozabadu maku ma Shimeyatu n Jehozabadu maku ma Shomeru. A̱ ciɗa̱ngu ni koɓolo n ikaya ni a̱ likuci i Dawuda. Ɗa Amaziya maku ma̱ ni wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Jehowahazu mogono mi Isaraila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamanga n ka tatsu ko tsugono tsu Jowashi maku ma Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda, Jehowahazu maku ma Jehu u gita̱i tsugono ci Isaraila a Samariya, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a̱ya̱ kupa na e cindere. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Ɗa u yaꞋin ili i gbani-gbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. U tonoi tsu na Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu u yaꞋin, u lyai kelime n kuyaꞋan unushi u na Jerobuwam u zuwai aza a Isaraila a yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu uyaꞋin wupa n aza a Isaraila ka̱u, ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i Haziyelu mogono ma Siriya n maku ma̱ ni Ben-hadadu u ka̱na̱i kulyaꞋa le n kuvon.<verse eid="2KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Ɗa Jehowahazu uyaꞋin avasa u Vuzavaguɗu u ɓa̱nka̱ le, ɗa u panai avasa a̱ ni, adama a na we ene ta̱ tsu na mogono ma Siriya mi o koꞋuso aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Ɗa Vuzavuguɗu u tuka̱i n vuza na u ki isa aza a Isaraila ekiye aza a Siriya. Ɗa aza a Isaraila a̱ ciya̱i ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ tsu na ishi cau. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Ama ɗa aza a Isaraila a lyai kelime n kuyaꞋan unushi, o ku tono uye u Jerobuwam. A̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kashamkpatsu ka ka̱ma̱li ka Ashera a Samariya kashani.<verse eid="2KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Babu ili i na a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ka̱i osoji a Jehowahazu, akumbi odoku amangere n kupa koci, n ekeke odoku kupa, n osoji a iɗika a̱kpa̱n kupa (10,000) adama a na mogono ma Siriya ma una ta̱ kagimi ɗa u bonokoi le tsu kubuta̱ ku na wunla̱i wi a̱ kupura̱.<verse eid="2KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jehowahazu, n ili i na u yaꞋin, n utsura u tsugono ci ni, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Ana Jehowahazu u bankai ukpisa̱, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngu ni a Samariya. Ɗa maku ma̱ ni Jowashi wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jowashi mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamangankupa na e cindere ko tsugono tsu Jowashi mogono ma Yahuda, Jowashi maku ma Jehowahazu wo okpoi mogono mi Isaraila a Samariya. Ɗa ulyaꞋi tsugono a̱ya̱ kupa n a̱ta̱li. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Ɗa uyaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. U iwain ku ka̱sukpa̱ unushi u na Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu u zuwai aza a Isaraila kuyaꞋan. Ɗa u tonoi uye u le.<verse eid="2KI 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jowashi, n ili i na u yaꞋin, n utsura u tsugono u ni n tsu na u lyaꞋi Ahaziya mogono ma Yahuda n kuvon, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Ana Jowashi u bankai ukpisa̱, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngu ni a Samariya koɓolo n ngono mi Isaraila. Ɗa Jerobuwam wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpa̱ u keneki Ilisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Ana Ilisha u vaki mɓa̱la̱ n na u kukuwa̱ ka̱, Jowashi mogono mi Isaraila u banai kene yi, ɗa u shika̱i u danai. &lt;&lt;Esheku a̱va̱, esheku a̱va̱, keke vo odoku n akumbi odoku a Isaraila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Ilisha u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ɗika utan n ayaꞋa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u yaꞋin tsu na u danai ni. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Ɗa Ilisha u danai mogon mi Isaraila, &lt;&lt;Rono utan u nu,&gt;&gt; Ɗa Ilisha u zuwai kukiye ku ni e kukiye ku mogono ka.<verse eid="2KI 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />U danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ɓa̱yuwa̱ katusu ka na ki a kinda kasana.&gt;&gt; Ɗa u ɓa̱yuwa̱i katusu ka. Ɗa Ilisha u danai ni, &lt;&lt;Tawa,&gt;&gt; ɗa u tawai. Ɗa Ilisha u danai, &lt;&lt;Kaya ka Vuzavaguɗu ka ulyaꞋi, kaya ka na ka kuciya̱ ulyaꞋi a Siriya, adama a na vi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa Siriya koɓolo n Afeku n kuvon ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Ilisha u doku danai ni, &lt;&lt;Ɗika aya ka̱ta̱ vu tawa iɗika.&gt;&gt;Ɗa mogono ma ɗikai kaya u tawai iɗika ali kutatsu ɗa u ka̱sukpa̱i. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Ɗa vuma vu Ka̱shile u yaꞋin wupa n a̱yi u danai. &lt;&lt;Vi ishi a ku tawa iɗika ya kutawun ko kuta̱li, vi ta̱ a kulya Siriya ali vu loko le ra̱ka̱. Ama gogo na kutatsu kuɗa vi a kulyaꞋa le koci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Ilisha u kuwa̱i ɗa̱ a̱ cigai ni. Koɓolo ka aza Mowabu a̱ tsu tuka̱ ta̱ iɗika yi Isaraila kuvon ka̱ya̱ dem. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Ana aza a Isaraila ilo a̱ kuciɗa̱ngu vuma vu yoku, gogolo ɗa enei uma a̱ bunda̱i a̱ kuta̱wa̱ le, ɗa a yaꞋin gogoꞋo a taɗuki keven ka ikyamba ka a kasaun ki Ilisha ɗa a sumai. Ana keven ki ikyamba ka ka saꞋwai etele a Ilisha, ɗa vuma va u bonoi n wuma ɗa u ɗa̱nga̱i kashani.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Haziyelu mogono ma Siriya u takacikai aza a Isaraila a makyan ma tsugono tsu Jehowahazu. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Ama adama a ucigi u Vuzavaguɗu a kubana a uma a Isaraila. Ɗa u panai asuvayali ele adama a uzuwakpani u na u yaꞋin n Ibrahim, n Ishaku, koɓolon Yakubu. Ali anana u ka̱sukpa̱ una le ba ko u loko le a̱ a̱shi a̱ ni ba.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Ana Haziyelu mogono ma Siriya ma̱ kuwa̱i, ɗa maku ma̱ ni Ben-hadadu wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Ɗa Jehowashi mogono mi Isaraila u lyai kelime ka Ben-hadadu maku ma Haziyelu ali kutatsu. Ɗa wi isai likuci ya aza Isaraila i na Ben-hadadu wi isai ekiye Jehowahazu esheku a Jehowashi.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Amaziya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Amaziya maku ma Jowashi u gita̱i tsugono tsu Yahuda a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ ire ko tsugono tsu Jowashi maku ma Jehowahazu mogono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Amaziya na̱ a̱ya̱ kamanga n a tawun ɗa wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ kamanga n kuci. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ɗa Jehowadin, vuza na wu uta̱i a Urushelima. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Amaziya u yaꞋan ta̱ ili i na yi mejege a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu, n nannai dem u yaꞋan tsa akaya a̱ ni Dawuda ba. Ɗa u tonoi tsa̱ esheku a̱ ni Jowashi. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Amaziya u takpa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a̱ma̱li ele ba, ɗa uma a̱ ka̱na̱i kubana na a yaꞋin kuneꞋe ka alyuka o kusongu ɗe a̱ uba̱ta̱ wa.<verse eid="2KI 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Ana Amaziya u yevei wo okpo ta̱ mogono, ɗa u zuwai a unai agbashi a na a unai esheku a̱ ni. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Ama wu una muku ma aza a na a unai esheku a̱ ni ba, u tonoi tsu na a ɗanai a katagarda ka Musa a na Vuzavaguɗu u danai, &lt;&lt;Isheku yi a̱ kukuwa̱ adama unushi u muku n le ba, ko muku n kuwa̱ adama unushi wi isheku i le ba. Yaba dem wi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱ adama unushi u ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />A̱yi ɗa wu unai aza a Edom a̱kpa̱n kupa (10,000) a̱ ka̱ɗa̱ka̱i ka mkpaɗi. Ɗa wi isai likuci i Sela n kuvon, ɗa u sabaꞋa ni kula wo okpoi Jokiteyelu. N kula ku ɗaɗa e tsu ɗekushe ubuta̱ wa ali anana.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Ɗa Amaziya usuki n alingata a kubana u Jehowashi maku ma Jehowahazu, matsukaya ma Jehu mogono mi Isaraila u danai, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱, tsu gasa a̱shi n a̱shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Ama ɗa Jehowashi mogono mi Isaraila wu ushuki Amaziya mogono ma Yahuda, u danai, &lt;&lt;Maɗanga ma kawana a Lebano u suki n akaka a kubana a maɗanga ma gbayin ma Sida a Lebano, u danai, &lt;Neke kolobo ka̱va̱ mekere ma̱ nu u zuwa.&gt; Ɗa manama ma kakamba mo yoku a kupasamgbanai ɗa u dasai kawana ka n ene. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Mayun ɗa vu lyaꞋa ta̱ aza a Edom, ɗa vu gita̱i ugbamukaci. Ama vu yaꞋan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama u lyaꞋi u na vu ciya̱i, vu da̱sa̱ngu a kpaꞋa. Yiɗa̱i i zuwai ɗa vi a kuciga ku ronoko ka̱ci ka̱ nu atakaci, n uma a iɗika i Yahuda kpamu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Ama ɗa Amaziya u kpa̱ɗa̱i kupana. Ɗa Jehowashi mogono mi Isaraila u banai vishili n Amaziya, mogono ma Yahuda. A Betu-shemeshi a iɗika i Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Osoji a Isaraila a lyaꞋi Yahuda n kuvon, ɗa yaba dem u sumai o kubono a kpaꞋa ku ni. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Jehowashi mogono mi Isaraila u remei mogono Amaziya ma Yahuda, maku ma Jowashi matsukaya ma Ahaziya, ɗe e Betu-shemeshi. Ɗa Jehowashi u banai u ɓosoi mashilya ma Urushelima ili i na i ɗikai a utsutsu u Ifirayimu a kubana utsutsu u mogon ma na ugaɗi u ni u yawai udashi amangatawa̱nta̱li (600). <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Ɗa u pura̱i azanariya n azurufa, n ucanuku u na wi a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu koɓolon n i na yi a̱ kunu ku kuzuwa a kpaꞋa ku mogono. N uma a na e nekei tsu kaguta, ɗa yeve u bonoi a Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jehowashi n ili i na u yaꞋin, n utsura u tsugono tsu ni n tsu na kpamu u lyaꞋi Amaziya mogono ma Yahuda n kuvon, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Ana Jehowashi u bankai ukpisa̱, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngu ni a Samariya koɓolon nu ngono mi Isaraila. Ɗa maku ma̱ ni Jerobuwam wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Amaziya maku ma Jowashi mogono ma Yahuda u yongoi n wuma ali a̱ya̱ gendu a na Jehowashi maku ma Jehowahazu mogono mi Isaraila u kuwa̱i. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Amaziya yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Ɗa a yaꞋin nsata adama a na a una Amaziya a Urushelima, ɗa u sumai a kubana a Lakishi. Ɗa a̱ suki uma a kubana a Lakishi, a una ni ɗe. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />O bonokoi keven ki ikyamba ka̱ ni a Urushelima o kodoku, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngu ni koɓolo n ikaya i ni a̱ likuci i Dawuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Ɗa uma a Yahuda ra̱ka̱ a ɗikai maku ma̱ ni Azariya vuza va̱ a̱ya̱ gendu n kete, a zuwai ni wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ we esheku a̱ ni Amaziya. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />A̱yi ɗa vuza na u maꞋasakai Ilatu ɗa u bonokoi ni iɗika i Yahuda a na esheku a̱ ni a̱ kuwa̱i.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jerobuwam vu ire mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ke gendu ko tsugono tsu Amaziya maku ma Jowashi mogono ma Yahuda, Jerobuwam maku ma Jowashi mogono mi Isaraila, wo okpoi mogono a Samariya. Ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a̱ya̱ amangere n kete. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />U yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. U iwain ku ka̱sukpa̱ unushi u na Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu u zuwai aza a Isaraila a yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />A̱yi ɗa u bonokoi kureꞋe ki iɗika yi Isaraila ili i na i ɗikai a Lebo-hamata a kubana e kuyene ku Araba, tsu na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu, Ka̱shile ka Isaraila ka na ka̱ uta̱i una̱ u Yunana maku ma Amita, keneki ka na ka̱ uta̱i a Gatu-hefaru.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu we ene ta̱ tsu na aza a Isaraila i atakaci a gbani-gbani, agbashi n aza a na i a gbashi ba, ra̱ka̱ vi le atakaci. Babu vuza na u kuɓa̱nka̱ le <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Vuzavaguɗu u dana an wi a kutakpa kula ki Isaraila a duniyan ba, wi ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ulinga n Jerobuwam maku ma Jowashi adama a na u wu isa le.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jerobuwam, n ili i na uyaꞋin ra̱ka̱, n utsura u tsugono ci ni, n tsu na uyaꞋin kuvon, n tsu na u bonokoi n aza a Isaraila n likuci i Dimaska n Hamata aza a na ishi a iɗika i Yahuda, ra̱ka̱ yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Jerobuwam u bankai ukpisa̱ nu ngono mi Isaraila. Ɗa maku ma̱ ni Zakariya wo okpoi mogono.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Azariya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamanga n ke cindere ko tsugono tsu Jerobuwam mogono mi Isaraila, Azariya maku ma Amaziya u gita̱i tsugono a Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />A̱yi n a̱ya̱ gendu n kete a na u gita̱i tsugono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ amangerenkupa n e re. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa Jekoliya a Urushelima. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />U yaꞋin ili i na yi mejege a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu, tsu na esheku a̱ ni Amaziya u yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />N nannai dem, u takpa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a̱ma̱li ba, ɗa uma a lyaꞋi kelime n kubana n a yaꞋin kuneꞋe ka alyuka n osongi ili ma̱gula̱ni ɗe.<verse eid="2KI 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u lapai mogono nu mɓa̱la̱ ma̱ ukutu, ali u kuwa̱i. Ɗa u yongoi a kpaꞋa ku ni kau. Jotan maku mo mogono ɗa a zuwai u la̱na̱ kpaꞋa ka, n uma a iɗika ya.<verse eid="2KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Azariya n ili i na u yaꞋin ra̱ka̱ yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Ana Azariya u bankai anan koko a̱ ni n kiya, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngu ni n ikaya i ni a̱ likuci i Dawuda. Ɗa Jotan maku ma̱ ni wo okpoi mogono.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakariya mogono mi Isaraila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamangankupa n kula̱i ko tsugono Azariya mogono ma Yahuda, Zakariya maku ma Jerobuwam u gita̱i tsugono ci Isaraila. U lyaꞋi tsugono a Samariya wotoi u ta̱li. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Zakariya u yaꞋin kagbanigbani u Vuzavaguɗu, tsu na ikaya i ni i yaꞋin. U ka̱sukpa̱ unushi u na Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu u yaꞋin ba a na u zuwai aza a Isaraila kuyaꞋan unushi.<verse eid="2KI 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Shalum maku ma Jabeshi u yaꞋin nsata adama a na a una Zakariya mogono, wu unai ni e kelime ka uma, ɗa wo okpoi mogono. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Zakariya wi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ngono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Ɗa kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka shanai ka na u yaꞋin a kubana u Jehu u danai, &lt;&lt;KpaꞋa ku nu ki ta̱ a̱ kuda̱sa̱ngu a kakuba ko tsugono ali tsukaya tsu na̱shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shalum mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Shalum maku ma Jabeshi u gita̱i tsugono a iɗika yi Isaraila a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamangankupa n kuci ka tsugono tsu Uziya mogono ma Yahuda, u lyaꞋi tsugono wotoi u te a Samariya. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Ɗa Menahem maku ma Gadi wu uta̱i a Tiza u banai a Samariya, wu unai Shalum mogono. Ɗa wo okpoi mogono.<verse eid="2KI 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Shalum, koɓolon nu nsata n na u yaꞋin, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila.<verse eid="2KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Makyan ma nanlo ɗa Menahem wu unai likuci i Tifasa n likuci i wawa i na yi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n a̱yi, adama a na uma a a iwan ta̱ kuneke utan. Ɗa wu unai a̱ma̱ci aza a̱ tsuma̱ u ka̱rukpa̱i a ɗa.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Menahem mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamangankupa n kuci ko tsugono tsu Azariya mogono ma Yahuda. Menahem maku ma Gadi u gita̱i tsugono ci Isaraila, U lyaꞋi tsugono a̱ likuci i Samariya a̱ya̱ kupa. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Ɗa Menahem u yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. A makyan mo tsugono tsu ni ra̱ka̱, u iwain kuka̱sukpa̱ unushi u Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu, a na u zuwai aza a Isaraila kuyaꞋan unushi. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Ɗa Pulu mogono ma Asiriya u banai kuvon a iɗika yi Isaraila. Ɗa Menahem u nekei ni azurufa a̱kpa̱n kamangankupa n e cindere (37,000) adama a na u ɓa̱nka̱ yi tsu na tsugono ci ni tsa kushamgba n utsura. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahem mogono u ciya̱i ikebe ya a̱ ubuta̱ wa aza ikebe i Isaraila, u zuwai le utafu vuma dem u tuka̱ n azurufa amangerenkupa u mogono ma Asiriya. Ɗa mogono ma Asiriya ma kucikpa ma̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kubanka aza a Isaraila n kuvon kpamu u da̱sa̱ngu a iɗika ya ba.<verse eid="2KI 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Menahem n ili i na u yaꞋin yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Ana Menahem u bankai ukpisa̱, ɗa Pekahiya maku ma̱ ni wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni. <verse eid="2KI 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ke gendu ko tsugono tsu Azariya mogono ma Yahuda, Pekahiya maku ma Menahem u gita̱i tsugono ci Isaraila a Samariya, ɗa u yaꞋin a̱ya̱ e re. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Ɗa u yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. U iwain ku ka̱sukpa̱ unushi u na Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu ma zuwai aza Isaraila kuyaꞋan. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Ɗa vuzagbayin vo osoji Peka maku ma Ramaliya, u yaꞋin nsata adama a na una yi. Koɓolo m uma amangerenkupa a Giliyadu. Peka wu unai mogono, koɓolo n Agobu n Ariya. E kefeku ka̱ ni a Samariya. Ɗa Peka wu unai Pekahiya ɗa wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Pekahiya n ili i na u yaꞋin yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ko ngono mi Isaraila.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peka mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka amangerenkupa n ere o tsugono tsu Azariya mogono ma Yahuda. Peka maku ma Ramaliya wo okpoi mogono mi Isaraila a̱ likuci i Samariya, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a̱ya̱ kamanga. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Ɗa Peka u yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. U iwain kuka̱sukpa̱ unushi u na Jerobuwam maku ma Nebatu ma zuwai aza a Isaraila kuyaꞋan.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Ayin a Peka mogono mi Isaraila, Tigilatu-piliza mogono ma Asiriya u ta̱wa̱i u ɗikai Ijonu, Ebelu-betu-maka, Janowa, Kedeshi n Hazoru. U ɗikai Giliyadu n Ga̱lili, koɓolon n iɗika i Nafutali, ɗa u bonokoi uma a, a Asiriya. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Ɗa Hosiya maku ma Ila ma yaꞋankai Peka maku ma Ramaliya nsata ɗa a una ni. Ɗa wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamanga ko tsugono tsu Jotan maku ma Uziya.<verse eid="2KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Peka n ili i na u yaꞋin yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono mi Isaraila.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jotan mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ ire ko tsugono tsu Peka maku ma Ramaliya mogono mi Isaraila, Jotan maku ma Uziya mogono ma Yahuda u gita̱i tsugono. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />A̱yi n a̱ya̱ kamanga na tawun a na wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ gendu n kete. Jerusha ɗa kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni mekere ma Zadoku. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Jotan u yaꞋin ili i na yi mejege a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu. U yaꞋin tsu na esheku a̱ ni Uziya a yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Ama u la̱nga̱sa̱ nva̱li ma̱ a̱ma̱li a ba, ɗa uma a lyaꞋi kelime ku bana ɗe n a yaꞋin kuneꞋe ku kusongu. Jotan u maꞋasakai utsutsu ugaɗi wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jotan n ili i na u yaꞋin yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka arabali ko ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Ayin a nanlo Vuzavaguɗu u gita̱i kusuku Rezin mogono ma Siriya n Peka maku ma Ramaliya a banka aza a Yahuda n kuvon. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Ana Jotan u bankai ukpisa̱, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngini koɓolo na anan koko a̱ni a̱ likuci i Dawuda esheku. Ɗa maku ma̱ni Ahazu wokpoi mogono.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ahazu mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n ke cindere ko tsugono tsu Peka kolobo ka Ramaliya, ɗa Ahazu kolobo ka Jotan mogono ma Yahuda u gita̱i tsugono. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahazu wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kamanga a na wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ gendu n ke te. Ɗa u kpa̱ɗa̱i kuyaꞋan ili i mejege a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ni, tsu na koko ni Dawuda u yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />U tonoi uye u mogono mi Isaraila, ali ɗa u yaꞋin alyuka akina n maku ma̱ ni, o kutono uye wu unata wu uduniyan u na Vuzavaguɗu u lokoi kafu aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />U yaꞋin alyuka e kuneꞋe ku kusongu n ili i ma̱gula̱ni a nva̱li, nu nsansa koɓolo n ubuta̱ wa nlulu mu nɗanga.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Ɗa Rezin mogono ma Siriya n Peka mogono kolobo ka Ramaliya mogono mi Isaraila a gaɗukpai adama a na a̱ shilika̱ n Urushelima, ɗa a kanza Ahazu, ama a fuɗai ba. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Ayin a nanlo tana Rezin mogono ma aza Siriya wi isa ɗe Ilatu adama Siriya, a na u lokoi aza a Yahuda. Ɗa aza Edom a banai a̱ da̱sa̱ngi ɗe ali n anana.<verse eid="2KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Ahazu u suki alingata a bana a dana Tigilatu-piliza mogono ma aza Asiriya na akaka u danai, &lt;&lt;Mpa kagbashi ka̱ nu kaꞋa, maku ma nu kpamu. Ta̱wa̱ vu isa mu ekiye o mogono ma Siriya m mogono ma aza a Isaraila, aza a na i o kuvon nu mpa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Ɗa Ahazu u ɗikai azurufa n azanariya a na u ciya̱i a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu n a na i a̱ kunu ku kuzuwa e kefeku ko mogono, ɗa u suꞋuki na a ɗa tsu kuneꞋe u mogono ma Asiriya. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Ɗa Tigilatu-piliza u panai ufolu u ni, ɗa u bankai Dimaska n kuvon, ɗa u lyaꞋi ni. Ɗa u pura̱i uma a̱ likuci a, a kubana a Kiru, ɗa wu unai Rezin.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Ɗa mogono Ahazu u banai Dimaska adama a na u gasa n Tigilatu-piliza mogono ma aza Asiriya. Ɗa we enei katalikalyuka. Ɗa u suꞋuki Uriya Ganu n iɗani yi iyoci i kaꞋa, n uteku tsu na a yaꞋin kaꞋa. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Ɗa Uriya Ganu u maꞋin katalikalyuka ka n iyoci tsu na mogono Ahazu u suꞋuki ɗe a Dimaska, ɗa u kotsoi kaꞋa kafu mogono Ahazu u bono. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Ana mogono mo bonoi a Dimaska ɗa we enei katalikalyuka ka, ɗa u banai ɗevu u nekei kuneꞋe ɗe. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />U yaꞋin kuneꞋe ku kusongu ku ni n ki ishina, ɗa u ɗarukpai ɗe kuneꞋe ku ma̱kya̱n ɗa u vishangi mpasa n kuneꞋen ku ma̱ta̱na̱ ɗe gaɗi vu katalikalyuka ka. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Ɗa u takpai katalikalyuka ka viyum vishili ka na ki e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa u zuwai ka a kakambu n uɓon u gaɗi n katalikalyuka ka savu ka. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Ɗa mogono Ahazu u nekei Uriya ganu kadanshi, u danai &lt;&lt;A katalikalyuka ka gbangam ka savu ka, vu neke ɗe kuneꞋe ka alyuka o kusongu n usana, n ka alyuka a ishina n kulivi, n ka alyuka o kusongu n ki ishina i mogono, koɓolo n ka alyuka a kuneꞋe ku kusongu ku uma iɗika ra̱ka̱, n kuneꞋe ka alyuka ki ishina ku le, n ki ili kusoꞋo ku le. Ka̱ta̱ vu vishangu mpasa ma alyuka n kuneꞋe kusongu n alyuka ra̱ka̱ ɗe gaɗi vu katalikalyuka ka. Ama n kuyaꞋan ta̱ ulinga n katalikalyuka ka viyum vishili ka adama a na n la̱nsa̱ uɓa̱nki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Ɗa Uriya ganu uyaꞋin tsu na Ahazu mogono u danai ni.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Ɗa Ahazu mogono u takpai e keɗetsu akambu a, ɗa wu utuka̱i n asasu a gbagbaꞋin a na i punu. Ɗa kpamu wu utuka̱i n kebelyu ka gbangam ka na a daɓangi gaɗi vi iyoci yo obomburon n iyum ishili ya, ɗa u zuwai le iɗika a gaɗi vu ulanga wa atali. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Ɗa u muɗa̱i kafalaka ka na mogono mo tsu tono a kanna ka ashibi, ɗa kpamu u takpai kafalaka ku uye ka kuꞋuwa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, u yaꞋan ta̱ nannai adama o mogono ma aza Asiriya.<verse eid="2KI 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Ahazu, n ili i na u yaꞋin dem, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ko ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ɗa Ahazu u bankai ukpisa̱ ɗa a ciɗa̱ngi ni koɓolo n ikaya i ni a̱ likuci Dawuda. Ɗa maku ma̱ ni Hezekaya wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Hosiya mogono mi Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n ka̱ ire ko tsugono tsu Ahazu mogono ma Yahuda, ɗa Hosiya kolobo ka Ila ko okpoi mogono mi Isaraila a Samariya, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a̱ya̱ kuci. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Ɗa u yaꞋin kagbanigbani u Vuzavaguɗu, ama ba tsu na ngono mi Isaraila n lyaꞋi tsugono kelime ka̱ ni ba.<verse eid="2KI 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Ɗa Shalumaneza mogono ma aza Asiriya u bankai Hosiya n kuvon ɗa u ciya̱i ulyaꞋi. Adama a nannai ɗa Isaraila u bonoi o kutono mogono ma Asiriya, ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i kubansuka yi n utafu. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Ama ɗa mogono ma Asiriya u zuwakai an Hosiya vuma gbani-gbani ɗa, adama a na u suꞋuku ta̱ So mogono ma Masar n akaka, ɗa kpamu u iwain kudoku kuneke mogono ma Asiriya utafu u ni, tsu na u kiwanai kuyaꞋansa ka̱ya̱ lakam. Adama a nannai ɗa Shalumaneza u remei ni ɗa u gbagurai a kunu ku ugbashi. <verse eid="2KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Ɗa mogono ma Asiriya ma bankai iɗika ya ra̱ka̱ n kuvon, ɗa u ka̱ra̱Ꞌi Samariya n kuvon ali a̱ya̱ a tatsu. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kuci ko tsugono tsu Hosiya. Ɗaɗa mogono ma Asiriya ma lyaꞋi Samariya n kuvon ɗa u pura̱i aza a Isaraila a kubana Asiriya. U zuwai le a Hala, a likuci Gozan a ka̱kina̱ ka kuyene ku Haboru n likuci ya aza a Midiya.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsugbashi tsa aza a Isaraila adama unushi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Ili nampa ya ra̱ka̱ i gita̱ ta̱ adama a na aza a Isaraila a nusaka ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le, a̱yi na wu uta̱ka̱i le a iɗika i Masar ekiye o mogono FiriꞋauna. A̱ ubuta̱ u na o tonoi a̱ma̱li o yoku <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />n kuyongo ka uduniyan u na Vuzavaguɗu o lokoi e kelime ke le, koɓolo n kuyongo ku na mogono mi Isaraila ma tuka̱i. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Aza Isaraila a yaꞋankai Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le kagbanigbani usokongi. A maꞋakai ka̱ci ka̱ le ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ likuci i le ra̱ka̱, ili i na i ɗikai a̱ likuci wawa ali a kubana a̱ likuci i gbagbain yi nshilya. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />A̱ shikpa̱ka̱i ka̱ci ka̱ le iyoci i ka̱ma̱li ka Ashera a̱ ubuta̱ wa nsansa m mululu ma nɗanga dem. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />A yaꞋin alyuka ɗa o songi ili i ma̱gula̱ni, tsu na uduniya u na Vuzavaguɗu u lokoi e kelime ke le a yaꞋin. Ɗa a yaꞋin ili i gbani-gbani i na i zuwai Vuzavaguɗu wupa. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Ɗa a cikpai a̱ma̱li a na Vuzavaguɗu u danai,&lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i cikpa le ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />Vuzavaguɗu u yongo ta̱ a kudanasa n aza a Isaraila n aza a Yahuda n una̱ u eneki n oboci ra̱ka̱, u danai, &lt;&lt;Kpatalai i ka̱sukpa̱ uye u gbani-gbani u ɗa̱, ka̱ta̱ i tono wila̱ n kadanshi ka̱ va̱, tsu na kuyotsongusu ku va̱ ki, ku na n danai ikaya i ɗa̱, n ku na kpamu n suꞋuki ɗa̱ n tsu una̱ wa agbashi a̱ va̱ eneki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Ama ɗa aza a Isaraila a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kupana, ɗa a yaꞋin ugbamukaci ci ikaya i le, aza a na a iwain kushuku n Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Ɗa a iwain wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu n uzuwakpani u na u yaꞋin n ikaya i le koɓolo n kadanshi ka na u danai i le. Ɗa o tonoi a̱ma̱li a gbani-gbani, ɗa e le feu okpoi aza a gbani-gbani. O tonoi kuyotsongusu ku uduniyan u na wi uka̱ra̱Ꞌi n ele, ko a na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i le, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i tono ili i na i a kuyaꞋansa ba,&gt;&gt; Ama ɗa a yaꞋin ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u sa̱nka̱i le a yaꞋan.<verse eid="2KI 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />A̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kadanshi ka na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le ka danai le ra̱ka̱, ɗa a̱ luwa̱ka̱i ka̱ci ke le a̱ma̱li e re tsu iyoci yi ndendem, n iyoci i ka̱ma̱li ka Ashara. A̱ kuɗa̱ngi a cikpai azangata ɗa kpamu a cikpai Balu. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Ɗa a lyukai muku n le nkere n olobo akina. Ɗa a piꞋisai tsuboci n a̱da̱bu, e dengei ka̱ci ka̱ le a̱ ubuta̱ u kuyaꞋan kagbanigbani e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu, ka na ka zuwai ni wupa.<verse eid="2KI 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Adama a nannai ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin wupa n aza a Isaraila ɗa u lokoi le a̱ a̱shi a̱ ni. Kumaci ku Yahuda ku ɗa koci u ka̱sukpa̱i. <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Aza Yahuda feu o tono wila̱ u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le ba, ɗa a kucikpa o tonoi kupiꞋisa ku na aza a Isaraila a̱ tuka̱i le. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Adama a nannai ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u iwain aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱, ɗa u takacikai le, ɗa u nekei le ekiye irala i le ali u zuwai le a̱ puwa̱nka̱i e kelime ka̱ ni ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱.<verse eid="2KI 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Ana u pecei aza a Isaraila n kpaꞋa ku Dawuda, ɗa a zuwai Jerobuwam kolobo ka Nebatu wo okpoi mogono me le. Ɗa Jerobuwam u zuwai aza a Isaraila a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i kutono Vuzavaguɗu, u zuwai le a yaꞋin unushi u gbayin. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Ɗa aza a Isaraila a lyaꞋi kelime n kuyaꞋan unushi u na Jerobuwam u yaꞋansai, a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ u ɗa ba, <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />ali Vuzavaguɗu u lokoi le e kelime ka̱ ni, tsu na u dansai a una̱ u wa agbashi a̱ ni eneki. Adama a nannai ɗa a ɗikai aza a Isaraila a iɗika i le a bankai tsugbashi a iɗika i Asiriya, kpamu ta ɗe a buwai ali n anana.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omoci a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a Isaraila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Ɗa mogono ma Asiriya ma̱ pura̱i uma a̱ likuci i Babila, n Kuta, n Ava, n Hamata n Sefarwayim, u zuwai le a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i Samariya una̱ wa aza a Isaraila. Ɗa isai iɗika i Samariya ɗa a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a likuci ya. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Ana a̱ da̱sa̱ngi ɗe n ugiti, o tono Vuzavaguɗu ba, ɗa u suki ikawu i banai yi unai aza o yoku a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ke le. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Ɗa a suꞋuki mogono ma Asiriya n akaka, a danai, &lt;&lt;Uduniya u na vu ɗikai ɗa vu zuwai le a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i Samariya ya, e yeve ili i na ka̱ma̱li ka̱ likuci ka ka cigai ba. Ɗa u suꞋuki le n ikawu, i na ya kuna le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Ɗa Mogono ma Asiriya me nekei kadanshi ka nampa, &lt;&lt;La̱nsa̱i ganu vu te a̱ ka̱tsa̱ma̱ ka aza a na i pura̱i a Samariya a kubana ugbashi, ka̱ta̱ i zuwa yi u bono ɗe u da̱sa̱ngu ɗe, ka̱ta̱ u yotsongu le ili i na ka̱ma̱li ka iɗika ya ka cigai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Ɗa vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza a na a̱ pura̱i a kubana ugbashi a̱ likuci i Samariya u bonoi ɗa u da̱sa̱ngi e Betelu ɗa u ka̱na̱i kuyotsongusu le tsu na o kutono Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Ama n nannai dem uma a yaꞋansai a̱ma̱li a̱ ka̱ci ke le a̱ likuci kakau i na a̱ da̱sa̱ngi, ɗa a̱ shikpa̱i le a̱ ubuta̱ u kucikpa wa aza a Samariya. Uduniyan kakau u yaꞋan ta̱ nannai feu a̱ likuci i na a̱ da̱sa̱ngi. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Aza a Babila a yaꞋin Sukotu-benotu, ɗa aza a Kuta a yaꞋin Neregalu, aza a Hamata tamkpamu a yaꞋin Ashima, <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />ɗa aza Avitu a yaꞋin Nibuhazu n Tarutaku, ɗa aza a Avitu o songi muku n le akina tsa alyuka a kubana u Adurameleki n Anameleki, ka̱ma̱li ka aza Avitu. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />A cikpai Vuzavaguɗu. Ama a tsu zagba ta̱ uma o yoku a ka̱tsuma̱ ke le okpo anan ganu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ wu nva̱li n le. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />A tsu cikpa ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu ama ka̱ta̱ kpamu a cikpa a̱ma̱li e le tsu na uduniyan a̱ ubuta̱ una utuka̱i le.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Ali n anana a buwa ta̱ ɗe o kutono ka̱ a̱kpisa̱ ku le tsu na a kiwanai. E le o tono Vuzavaguɗu ba, tana o tono wila̱ u ni n kadanshi ka̱ ni ba, wila̱ n kadanshi ka na Vuzavaguɗu u nekei kumaci ku Yakubu, a̱ yi na u neꞋi kula Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Ana Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin uzuwakpani n aza a Isaraila, u danai le ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i tono a̱ma̱li o yoku, ko i kuɗa̱nku le ba, ka̱ta̱ kpamu i cikpa le ko i yaꞋanka le alyuka ba. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Ama Vuzavaguɗu a̱yi na wu utuka̱i ɗa̱ n kukiye ku utsura ku gbangam ku ni a Masar, a̱yi ɗa koci vuza na i kutono. A̱yi ɗa ya ku kuɗa̱nku a̱yi ɗa kpamu ya kuneke alyuka a̱ɗa̱. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Mayun ɗa i tono wila̱, n kadanshi ka̱ ni, n ili i kutono i na u ɗanakai ɗa̱. Ka̱ta̱ i tono a̱ma̱li o yoku ba. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Ka̱ta̱ i cinukpa n uzuwakpani u na n yaꞋin n a̱ɗa̱ ba, kpamu ka̱ta̱ i tono a̱ma̱li o yoku ba. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Ama i tono Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱, a̱yi ɗa vuza na u ki isa ɗa̱ ekiye irala i ɗa̱ ra̱ka̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Ama n nannai dem ɗa a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kupana, ama ɗa a lyaꞋi kelime n kutono kupiꞋisa ku na a kiwanai. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Ko a na uma a nampa i a o kutono Vuzavaguɗu, a lyaꞋa ta̱ kelime n kutono a̱ma̱li e le. Ali n anana muku n le nu ntsukaya n le a buwa ta̱ ɗe a kuyaꞋan tsu na ikaya i le i yaꞋin.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekaya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka tatsu ko tsugono tsu Hosiya kolobo ka Ila mogono mi Isaraila, ɗa Hezekaya kolobo ka Ahazu mogono ma Yahuda u gita̱i kulyaꞋa tsugono. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />A̱yi na̱ a̱ya̱ kamanga n a tawun a ɗa wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ kamanga n kuci. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa Abi mekere ma Zakariya. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />U yaꞋin ili i na yi mejege a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu, derere tsu na esheku a̱ ni Dawuda u yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />U fa̱da̱i nva̱li n atali a ciɗa, ɗa u kapai ka̱ma̱li ka Ashera. Ɗa u ɓosoi koko ka̱ viyum vishili ka na Musa u yaꞋin, adama a na ali n anana aza a Isaraila i ta̱ a kuyaꞋansaka ka a̱tsa̱ka̱na̱. E ci ɗeke ta̱ koko ka n kula Nehushatan.<verse eid="2KI 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hezekaya wushuku ta̱ n Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila. Babu vuza na a kugisanku n a̱yi a̱ ka̱tsa̱ma̱ ko ngono n Yahuda ra̱ka̱, ko aza a na a lyaꞋi tsugono kelime ka̱ ni ko ka̱ca̱pa̱ ka̱ ni. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />U gbagai Vuzavaguɗu mayin, u ka̱sukpa̱ yi ba, ama u tonoi wila̱ u na Vuzavaguɗu u nekei Musa. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yongoi koɓolo n a̱yi, ɗa u ka̱na̱i kuciya̱ u lyaꞋi a̱ ubuta̱ wi ili i na u yaꞋin dem. Adama a nannai ɗa u yaꞋankai mogono ma Asiriya ugbamiwasuvu, u iwain ku yaꞋanka yi tsugbashi. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Ili na i ɗikai ɗe a kaginda ka kindi a kubana a̱ likuci yi nshilya, ɗa u lyaꞋi a za Filistiya n kuvon ali a kubana a Gaza n kureꞋe ku ni.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ na̱shi ko tsugono tsu Hezekaya, ka na ko okpoi ka̱ya̱ ke cindere ko tsugono tsu Hosiya kolobo ka Ila mogono mi Isaraila, ɗa Shalumaneza mogono ma Asiriya ma bankai Samariya kuvon ɗa u kanzai i ɗa. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />A ukocishi u ka̱ya̱ ka tatsu, ɗa Shalumaneza wi isai likuci i Samariya. Adama nanai a isai Samariya a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ ta̱li ko tsugono tsu Hezekaya, ka na ko okpoi ka̱ya̱ ka̱ kuci ko tsugono tsu Hosiya mogono mi Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Ɗa mogono ma Asiriya ma pura̱i aza a Isaraila a kubana Asiriya, ɗa u zuwai le a̱ da̱sa̱ngi a̱ likuci i Hala i na yi a̱ ka̱kina̱ ka kuyene ku Haboru a Gozan. Ɗa kpamu u zuwai aza a yoku a̱ likuci ya aza Midiya. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />I nampa ya i yain ta̱ adama a na aza a Isaraila a iwain kutono Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ke le, ɗa kpamu o koɗoi uzuwakpani u ni, u na Musa kagbashi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka tonokoi le. A iwain kupana, ɗa kpamu a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono u ɗa.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sanakaribu u takacikai Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n ka̱ na̱shi ko tsugono tsu Hezekaya, ɗa Sanakaribu mogono ma Asiriya u bankai likuci yi nshilya ma aza a Yahuda ra̱ka̱ n kuvon ɗa u remei le. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Ɗa Hezekaya mogono ma Yahuda u suꞋuki mogono ma Asiriya n akaka a nampa a Lakishi, u danai, &lt;&lt;N yaꞋan ta̱ unushi, ka̱sukpa̱ mu, mi ta̱ a kutsupa i na baci vu danai n tsupa.&gt;&gt; Ɗa mogono ma Asiriya ma danai Hezekaya mogono ma Yahuda ma nekei azurufa amangatawantatsu (300) n azanariya kamangankupa. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Ɗa Hezekaya u nekei ni azurufa ra̱ka̱, a na a cinai a̱Ꞌisa̱ a vuzavaguɗu koɓolo n a na a cinai kunu ku kuzuwa e kefeku ko mogono.<verse eid="2KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />A makyan ma nanlo tana Hezekaya wu ura ɗe azanariya a na u surai utsutsu wu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu n a na u surai a urotu wu utsutsu, ɗa u nekei mogono ma Asiriya.<verse eid="2KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Ɗa mogono ma Asiriya ma̱ suki vuza kelime vo osoji a̱ ni koɓolo n ovonshi a̱ ni n a̱bunda̱i, uta̱i a Lakishi a kubana u mogono Hezekaya a Urushelima. Ɗa a lazai a kubana a Urushelima, a na a yawai ɗa a shamgbai a uɓon uye u mini u na wi a̱ kuꞋuwa̱ a kaginda, ɗevu n uye u na u lazai a kubana a̱ ubuta̱ u kuza̱Ꞌa̱. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Ana e ɗekei mogono Hezekaya, ɗa Eliyakimu kolobo ka Hilikiya, vuzagbayin vu kefeku ko mogono, n Shebuna kaɗani ka̱ kunu ka afada, koɓolo n Jowa kolobo ka Asafu kaɗani uta̱i.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Ɗa vuza kelime vo osoji u danai le, &lt;&lt;Danai Hezekaya a kaka a nampa, &lt;I na mogono magbayin ma aza Asiriya ma dansai i ɗana, a̱n yiɗa̱i vi e kukeɗe a̱pa̱Ꞌa̱? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Vu dana vi ta̱ n ugboji n utsura wo osoji, na lo kadanshi kagbani ka koci vi a kuyaꞋan. U yayi vu zuwai katsura ka̱ nu, ali ɗa vi a kuyaꞋanka mu ugbamiwasuvu? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />La̱na̱, ɗa baci vu zuwai katsura ka̱ nu a Masar, a̱yi na wi an kakungu ka na ka ci kiɗa vuma kukiye, ka̱ta̱ ka uka yi usa̱n a ayin a na u tsubaki a ka a. Ta FiriꞋauna mogono ma Masar mi nannai u vuza na baci de dem u zuwai katsura ka ni wa̱ a̱ ni. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Ama ɗa baci vu danai mu, &lt;&lt;Tsu zuwa ta̱ katsura ka tsu u Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu.&gt;&gt; A̱yi ɗa vuza na Hezekaya u fa̱da̱i ubuta̱ u cikpa u ni n atalialyuka a ba? Ɗa kpamu udanai aza Yahuda n Urushelima &lt;&lt;A katalikalyuka ka nampa ka koci ya kuyaꞋan kucikpa a Urushelima ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ta̱wa̱ na, i yaꞋan tsulaga n vuzagbayin vu va̱, mogono ma Asiriya. N kuneke wu ta̱ odoku a̱kpa̱n e re (2,000), vi baci a̱ kuciya̱ akumbi e le. <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Niniɗai va kufuɗa va ciya̱ ulyai n osoji e kenu a̱ nu, niniɗai va kusheshe kushilika̱ n kosoji ka babu utsura ka vuzagbayin va̱, ko nu uɓa̱nki wa ekeke odoku n akumbi aza a Masar? <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Ko n nannai ba, vu ene ta̱ adanshi n utsura u Vuzavaguɗu u ɗa tsu lyaꞋi iɗika ya ba? Vuzavaguɗu ɗa n ka̱ci ka̱ ni u danai tsu, bankai likuci ya n kuvon ka̱ta̱ yi una i ɗa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Ɗa Eliyakimu kolobo ka Hilikiya, n Shebuna koɓolo n Jowa a danai Vuza vu kelime vo osoji, &lt;&lt;Tsu folono wu ta̱ yaꞋan kadanshi n kelentsu ka aza a Arami, adama a na tsu laꞋa ta̱ n kufuɗa kaꞋa mayin. Ka̱ta̱ vu yaꞋanka tsu kadanshi n kelentsu ka aza a Ibirahi ba, talo aza na i a gaɗi a mashilya ma̱ likuci a pana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Ama ɗa vuza kelime vo osoji va wushuki, u danai, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗa̱ i sheshe ta̱ ko wu a̱ɗa̱ u ɗa n vuzagbayin vu ɗa̱ ɗa vuzagbayin vu va̱ u suki n akaka a nampa a koci? A̱yi u ciga ta̱ yaba dem u pana aɗa, adama a na ayin a na baci tsu kambuki likuci i nampa, i ta̱ a ku takacika koɓolo n a̱ɗa̱. I ta̱ a kupana kambulu n kakuli ali a lyaꞋa a̱wiya̱n e le, ka̱ta̱ kpamu o soꞋo akyana e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Ɗa vuza vu kelime va u ɗa̱nga̱i kashani u ɗekei aza a Ibrahim, u danai,&lt;&lt;Panai akaka o mogono ma gbayin vuzagbayin mogono ma Asiriya. <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Ili i na mogono ma dansai i ɗaɗa na. &lt;Ka̱ta̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ Hezekaya u doro ɗa̱ ba. Wi a kufuɗa ku isa ɗa̱ ekiye a̱va̱ ba. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Ka̱ta̱ i ka̱sukpa̱ Hezekaya u bono ko ɗa̱ alau i zuwa a̱ɗu a̱ɗa̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u kutono Vuzavaguɗu, i dana, mayun Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a ku isa tsu. E kuneke likuci i nampa ya ekiye o mogono ma Asiriya ba.&gt; <verse eid="2KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Ka̱ta̱ i pana kadanshi ka Hezekaya ba, ili i na mogono ma Asiriya ma dansai i ɗaɗa na. &lt;La̱nsa̱i ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ nu mpa, ka̱ta̱ yu uta̱ i ta̱wa̱ wa̱ a̱ va̱. Ka̱ta̱ yaba dem u lyaꞋa umaci u kashina ki itacishi ka̱ ni n nɗanga m ma̱biri, ka̱ta̱ kpamu yaba dem u soꞋo mini o mogbodo ma̱ ni, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />ali a makyan ma na n kuta̱wa̱ ma̱ pura̱ ɗa̱ a kubana a iɗika i na yi ci iɗika i ɗa̱, iɗika i na yi n ishina, n ma̱kya̱n ma savu, iɗika yi ilikulyaꞋa n ashina itacishi koɓolo n nɗanga n zaitu n ishigi. Zagbai wuma ba ukpa̱ ba. Ka̱ta̱ i pana kadanshi ka Hezekaya ba, adama a na wi ta̱ a kuvaruku ɗa̱, a na u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu wi ta̱ a kisa tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />ka̱ma̱li ku uduniyan u yoku ki ta̱ lo, ka na ka sawai kisa iɗika ekiye o mogono ma Asiriya? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Teɗei a̱ma̱li a Hamata n Arapadu? Teɗei kpamu a̱ma̱li a Sefaravim, n Hena, n a Iwa? A fuɗa ta̱ isa Samariya ekiye a̱va̱? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Yayi a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka̱ a̱ma̱li a iɗika i nampa ka na ka kufuɗa kisai iɗika i ni ekiye a̱va̱? Adama a nannai niniɗai Vuzavaguɗu wi a kufuɗa ku isa Urushelima ekiye a̱va̱?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Ama ɗa uma a, a paɗai bini, e keɓece yi ukuna ba, adama a na mogono ma dana le ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i keɓece yi kakuna ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Ɗa Eliyakimu kolobo ka Hilikiya, vuzagbayin e kefeku ko mogono, n Shebuna kaɗani ka̱ kunu ka afada n Jowa maku ma Asafu, a banai u Hezekaya n ntogu n le ukari, ɗa a danai mogono ili i na vuza kelime vo osoji a Asiriya u dansai.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekaya u la̱nsa̱i uɓa̱nki u Vuzavaguɗu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Ana Hezekaya mogono u panai i na a danai, ɗa u karai ntogu n ni ɗa u ukai akashi a kpalu ɗa u banai a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Ɗa u suki Eliyakimu vuzagbayin vu kefeku ko mogono, n Shebuna kaɗani, koɓolo n anan ganu a gbagbain, ra̱ka̱ vu le u uki n akashi a kpalu ɗa a banai u keneki Ishaya kolobo ka Amazo. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Ɗa a danai ni, &lt;&lt;I na Hezekaya mogono u danai i ɗanna. Anana kanna ka atakaci kaꞋa, ki ishikushi, n ko wono. Ki ta̱ an kanna ka̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, kpamu vuka va vu buwa n utsura u na wa kufuɗa wa matsa ba. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Ugan ba Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ka pana ta̱ kadanshi ka̱ a̱ra̱ɗi ka na vuza kelime vo osoji a Asiriya u dansai, a na vuzagbayin vi ni mogono ma Asiriya ma̱ suku ni u dana Ka̱shile ka wuma, yoku ba Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ nu ki ta̱ o ku ɓongo yi adama a kadanshi ka. Adama a nannai vasa adama a̱tsu na tsu buwai na.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Ana nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ o mogono Hezekaya a yawai u Ishaya, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />ɗa Ishaya u danai, &lt;&lt;Dana vuzagbayin vu nu, &lt;I na Vuzavaguɗu u dansai i ɗanna. Ka̱ta̱ vu takacika ka̱ci ka̱ nu adama a kadanshi kagbanigbani ka na vu panai adama a̱va̱ a ubuta̱ wa aza a usuki o mogono ma Asiriya ba. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />La̱na̱, mi ta̱ a kuzuwaka yi ayinviki o yoku a na a kuzuwa yi u pana kadanshi ka na ka kuzuwa yi u kpatala o kubono a iɗika i ni, a̱ ubuta̱ u na n kuzuwa una yi ɗe n kotokobi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Ana vuza kelime vu mogono ma u panai a danai mogono ma Asiriya ma ka̱sukpa̱i Lakishi, ɗa u loloi ɗa u banai u cinai mogono a vishili n aza a Libina. <verse eid="2KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Ana mogono ma panai ukuna adama Tirihaka mogono ma Itopiya, &lt;&lt;Adama na wu uta̱i ku shilika̱ n a̱yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗa kpamu u doku ɗa u suki aza a usuki u Hezekaya a dana yi. <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />&lt;&lt;Nanai ɗa ya kudana Hezekaya mogono ma a Yahuda. &lt;Ka̱ta̱ vu ka̱sukpa̱ Ka̱shile ka̱ nu, ka na vushuki n a̱yi, ka̱ ya̱nsa̱ wu n kadanshi ba, a kudana a kuneke Urushelima ekiye a mogono ma Asiriya ba. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />La̱na̱, vu pana ta̱ i na ngono n Asiriya n yaꞋankai iɗika ra̱ka̱, tsu na a unai le gbende. Avu vi ta̱ a kulaka? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />A̱ma̱li uduniyan a nampa isa le ta̱, uduniyan u na ikaya i va̱ i la̱nga̱sa̱i, Gozan, n Haran, n Rezefa, n uma Adini aza a na i a Telasaru? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Teɗei mogono ma Hamata, n mogono ma Arapadu, n mogono ma likuci i Sefaravim, n Hena koɓolo n Iva?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Avasa a Hezekaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Ana Hezekaya wi isai akaka a katagarda ka na aza a usuki a a̱ tuka̱i ɗa u kecei, ɗa u ɗikai kaꞋa ɗa u uwai a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u ɓa̱yuwa̱i kaꞋa e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Ɗa Hezekaya u yaꞋin avasa u Vuzavaguɗu, u danai, &lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila, avu na vi ida̱shi a kakuba ko tsugono e mere mo Corobi, avu endeꞋin avu ɗa Ka̱shile ko tsugono tsu aduniyan ra̱ka̱. Avu ɗa vu yaꞋin gaɗi n iɗika. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Zuwa atsuvu, vu pana, Vuzavaguɗu. Ɓa̱yuwa̱ a̱shi a̱ nu ka̱ta̱ vu ene. Vu Pana kadanshi ki ishikushi ka na Sanakaribu u yaꞋankai nu Ka̱shile ka wuma. <verse eid="2KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />Mayun ɗa, Vuzavaguɗu, ngono ma Asiriya n la̱nga̱sa̱ ta̱ uduniyan n iɗika i le. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />kpamu ɗa u variki a̱ma̱li e le akina. Adama a na e le a̱ma̱li a ɗa ba, ama nɗanga n atali a ɗa, a na uma a yaꞋin n ekiye. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Gogo na, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ tsu, isa tsu ekiye a̱ ni, adama a na tsugono tsu uduniyan ra̱ka̱ ci yeve an avu ɗa koci Vuzavaguɗu, Ka̱shile.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kene ku Ishaya adama uyikpi u Sanakaribu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Ɗa Ishaya kolobo ka Amazo ka̱ suki n akaka a kubana u Hezekaya. U danai, &lt;&lt;Ili i na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila ka danai i ɗaɗa na, m pana ta̱ avasa a̱ nu adama Sanakaribu mogono ma Asiriya. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Kadanshi ka na Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin adama a̱ ni ka ɗaɗa na,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2KI 19:21" />
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">&lt;&lt;Likuci i Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">i goyo wu ta̱ ɗa kpamu i zoꞋoshi nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">likuci i Urushelima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">a̱ kugba̱ɗa̱sa̱ ka̱ wu kaci tsu na vi ilaɗi.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />&lt;&lt;Yayi vu goyoi ɗa vi a kushika?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">Yayi vi a̱ kuɗa̱ngusa̱ka̱ ka̱la̱ka̱tsu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">yayi kpamu vi a kinda n a̱shi a̱ra̱ɗi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Vuza ciɗa vi Isaraila ɗa.<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />Vu suku ta̱ aza a usuki a̱ nu a shika Vuzavaguɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">ɗa vu danai, &lt;N ka̱bunda̱i ka keke odoku a̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">a ɗa n kumbai nsasan mu ugaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">n na n laꞋi n ugaɗi ra̱ka̱ a Lebano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Ɗa n poloi nɗanga n sida n na n laꞋi n ugaɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">nu nɗanga n Firi n na n laꞋi n ugaꞋin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">n uwa ta̱ punu e mere ma̱ kutsun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">kutsun ku umaci u singai ku ni.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />N ga̱va̱i ayinva a̱ likuci i yoku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">ɗa n soꞋi mini mo omoci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">ɗa n ɗekpetengi n ataka e ene a̱va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">nyeneke m masar ra̱ka̱.&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />&lt;&lt;Vu pana ba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">A na n sheshei ukuna u nampa ɗe ali megeshe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Ili i na n sheshe ɗe megeshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">i ɗaɗa yi a kushana gogo na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">tsu na vi o kubonoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">likuci yi ukanji agali.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Ka̱ta̱ uma a na i ida̱shi punu okpo babu utsura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">i ta̱ e kujeꞋeke ikyamba, ka̱ta̱ a̱ ripula̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Okpo tsu mita̱ ma̱ ka̱pula̱ka̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">tsu mita̱ ma na muta̱i a kashina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">tsu mita̱ ma na mu uta̱i gaɗi vu kukpa̱Ꞌa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">ma na ma tsu ɗekpe babu mo gbonguro.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />&lt;&lt;Ama n yeve ta̱ mayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">ubuta̱ u na vu ci yongo, kuta̱wa̱ ku nu n kulaza ku nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">N yeve ta̱ tsu na vi a wupa nu mpa.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Adama a na vu yaꞋan ta̱ wupa nu mpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">n ugbamukaci u nu, m pana ta̱ arabali a̱ nu n ka̱ci ka̱va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">gogo na mi ta̱ a kuzuwa kuɗopi a̱ vunu vu nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">ka̱ta̱ n uka mojubo a̱ una̱ u nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">ka̱ta̱ n zuwa wu vu kpatala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">o kubono n uye u na vu tuka̱i.<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />&lt;&lt;Ɗa Ishaya u danai Hezekaya, na va wi ta̱ o kokpo urotu wa̱ nu, ka̱ya̱ ka lala yi ta̱ a kulyaꞋa ili i na yi uta̱i n ka̱ci ka̱ ni, ka̱ta̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ e re i lyaꞋa uta̱ci. Ama a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka tatsu i ca̱Ꞌa̱ ishina i ɗa̱ ka̱ta̱ i kyaꞋa, i ca̱Ꞌa̱ ashina itacishi ali i lyaꞋa umaci u le. <verse eid="2KI 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Kagimi ka ka kpaꞋa ku Yahuda, ki ta̱ o kutopo tsu nɗanga n na n zuwai aralu e le a iɗika ɗa a matsai. <verse eid="2KI 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Kagimi ka uma a na a buwai n wuma uta̱ ta̱ a Urushelima n ka̱tsura̱ ka uma a na a laꞋakai a kusan ku Sihiyona, adama a na ucigi u Vuzavaguɗu MalaꞋimili ɗa u sheshei kuyaꞋan nanai.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />&lt;&lt;Adama a nannai, ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗanna a ukuna u mogono ma Asiriya. Wi a kuꞋuwa a̱ likuci i nampa ko u taɗuku kayaꞋa punu ba. Wi tana feu a̱ kuta̱wa̱ nu nra̱ga̱ ko u maꞋa adasukpatsu adama a na u kumba mashilya ma̱ ni ba. <verse eid="2KI 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Wi ta̱ o kubono n uye u na wu uta̱ka̱i, wi a ku uwa a̱ likuci i nampa ya ba. Mpa Vuzavaguɗu n dansa ta̱. <verse eid="2KI 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />Mi ta̱ a̱ kuɓa̱nka̱ likuci i nampa ka̱ta̱ mi isa i ɗa, adama a tsugbayin tsu va̱ n uzuwakpani u na n yaꞋin n kagbashi ka̱va̱ Dawuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />N kayin ka nanlo ɗa kalingata ka Vuzavaguɗu ka banai ɗa ka unai osoji aza a Asiriya a̱kpa̱n amangatawun na amanga̱na̱shi n a tawun (185,000). Ana kayin kasai ɗa a cinai uma vagali ukpa̱. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Ɗa Sanakaribu mogono ma Asiriya u sumai ɗa u bonoi a Niniva ɗa u da̱sa̱ngi ɗe. <verse eid="2KI 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Kanna kete, a̱yi a̱ ma̱va̱li a kucikpa ka̱ma̱li ka̱ ni Nisaroku, ɗa muku nre n ni Adurameleki koɓolo n Shareza unai ni n kotokobi, ɗa a sumai a kubana iɗika i Arara. Ɗa kolobo ka̱ ni, Isarahadon wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mɓa̱la̱ n Hezekaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />A ayin a nanlo, Hezekaya u ka̱na̱i mɓa̱la̱ ali ɗevu n ukpa̱. Ɗa Ishaya keneki kolobo ka Amazo ka banai kene yi ɗa u danai ni, ili i na Vuzavaguɗu u danai i ɗanna vu foɓuso kpaꞋa ku nu, adama a na vi a kulaꞋa ba. Vi ta̱ a̱ kukuwa̱.<verse eid="2KI 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Ɗa Hezekaya u kpatalai a̱shi a̱ ni a kasaka ɗa u vasai u Vuzavaguɗu. U danai, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu ciɓa, tsu na kagbashi ka̱ nu ko tonoi nu mayin n ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni ra̱ka̱, kpamu n yaꞋan ta̱ ili i singai a̱ a̱shi a̱ nu.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Hezekaya u shika̱i wuya-wuya.<verse eid="2KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Ama babu na Ishaya wu uta̱ ulanga u mere me kefeku ma, ɗa kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka̱ ta̱wa̱i wa̱ ni. <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />&lt;&lt;Kpatala vu bono vu dana Hezekaya, vuza kelime vu uma a̱ va̱, ili i na Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile, Ka̱shile ka esheku a̱ nu Dawuda ka danai i ɗanna, m pana ta̱ avasa a̱ nu, kpamu mene ta̱ kujilya ku nu, adama nannai, mi ta̱ o kupotsokpo wu, ka̱ta̱ a kanna ka tatsu vu bana a̱ Isa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />ka̱ta̱ n doku wu a̱ya̱ gendu a wuma. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu mi isa wu n likuci i nampa ekiye o mogono ma Asiriya, mi ta̱ a ki isa likuci i nampa adama a̱ ka̱ci ka̱ va̱ n kagbashi ka̱ va̱ Dawuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Ɗa Ishaya u danai, &lt;&lt;Tuka̱i n ka̱vu ka ma̱biri ka̱ta̱ i paɗaka kamici ka, adama na u potso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Ɗa Hezekaya we ecei Ishaya, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i yo kokpo urotu u na Vuzavaguɗu u ku potsokpo mu, ali n fuɗa m bana a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu a kanna ka tatsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Ɗa Ishaya u danai, &lt;&lt;Na ɗa wo kokpo urotu u Vuzavaguɗu wa̱ nu, a kudana, Vuzavaguɗu u kuyaꞋan ta̱ i na u yaꞋin uzuwakpani. Gogo na zagba i na vu laꞋi n kuciga, kululu ku laza kelime n udashi kupa, ko kubono ka̱ca̱pa̱ n udashi kupa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Ɗa Hezekaya wu ushuki, u danai,&lt;&lt;Ili ya atakaci i ɗa ba kululu kudoku ugaɗi kelime ali udashi kupa. A na ko kubono ka̱ca̱pa̱ udashi kupa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Ɗa Ishaya keneki u vasai u Vuzavaguɗu, ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u bonokoi kululu ka ka̱ca̱pa̱ ali udashi kupa, cina ɗe ku laza udashi u Ahazu mogono.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aza a usuki a na uta̱i a Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />A makyan ma nanlo tana, Merodaka-baladan maku ma Baladan mogono ma Babila, kolobo ka Baladan, u suki n akaka koɓolo n kuneꞋe u mogono Hezekaya, adama a na u pana ta̱ arabali a na wi gbaga ba. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Ɗa Hezekaya u rabasai le, ɗa u yotsongi le unu a kuzuwa a̱ ni, azanariya n azurufa a̱ ni, ili i wali n ili i ma̱gula̱ni, m mani ma singai ma̱ ni, n ucanuku u kuvon u ni koɓolo n ili ra̱ka̱ i na yi punu a̱ kunu kuzuwa ka. Babu i na i buwai a kpaꞋa ku ni, ko tsugono tsu ni, i na Hezekaya u kpa̱ɗa̱i ku yotsongu le.<verse eid="2KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Ɗa keneki Ishaya u banai u mogono, ɗa we ecei, &lt;&lt;Teɗai uma a nampa uta̱i? Yiɗa̱i a cigai?&gt;&gt; Ɗa mogono Hezekaya wu ushuki, u danai, &lt;&lt;Uta̱ ta̱ a iɗika i daꞋin, a Babila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Ɗa keneki Ishaya we ecei ni, &lt;&lt;Yiɗa̱i vi yotsongi le a kpaꞋa ku nu?&gt;&gt; Ɗa mogono Hezekaya wu ushuki, &lt;&lt;E ene ta̱ ili ra̱ka̱ i na yi punu a kpaꞋa ku va̱, Babu i na yi a̱ kunu ku kuzuwa ku va̱, i na n kpa̱ɗa̱i kuyotsongu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Ɗa Ishaya u danai Hezekaya, &lt;&lt;Pana kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />La̱na̱, kanna ki ta̱ lo a̱ kuta̱wa̱, ka na a̱ kupura̱ ili i na vi ni i ɗa a̱ kunu ku kuzuwa ku nu, n i na ikaya i nu i foɓoi a ayin cau ali a kuta̱wa̱ anana a banka a Babila. Ko ili ite a kubuka wu ba. Vuzavaguɗu ɗa u dansai. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Ka̱ta̱ muku n nu n yoku n na vu matsai, a ɗika n ɗa, ka̱ta̱ o bonoko le ndari e kefeku ko mogono ma Babila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Ɗa Hezekaya u danai Ishaya, &lt;&lt;Kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka na vu danai mu kasingai kaꞋa,&gt;&gt; Adama a na u sheshe ta̱, &lt;&lt;Babu ili yoku i baci a̱ kuciya̱ ida̱shi i ma̱ta̱na̱ a ayin a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Hezekaya n ili i na u yaꞋansai, n ukuna wu utsura u tsugono u ni, n tsu na u ga̱va̱i kayinva, n nka̱riki n na n tsu tuka̱ n mini a̱ likuci, i ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka tsumani tsu ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Ɗa Hezekaya u bankai ukpisa̱. Ɗa Manasa kolobo ka̱ ni ko okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ ni.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Manasa mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manasa wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kupa n e re a na u gita̱i kulyaꞋa tsugono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono tsu Urushelima a̱ya̱ amangerenkupa n tawun kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa Hafiziba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Ɗa u yaꞋankai Vuzavaguɗu kagbanigbani, o kutono uye wu unata wu uduniyan u na Vuzavaguɗu u lokoi e kelime ka aza a Isaraila. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Adama a na u doku ta̱ u maꞋasaka ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ u na Hezekaya esheku a̱ ni o ɓosoi, ɗa kpamu u maꞋakai ka̱ma̱li ka Balu katalikalyuka, ɗa u yaꞋin kululu ku Ashera tsu na Ahabu mogono mi Isaraila ma yaꞋin. Ɗa kpamu u kuɗa̱nki wotoi n azangata u yaꞋankai le tsugbashi. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Ɗa u maꞋin atalikalyuka a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu a̱ ubuta̱ u na Ka̱shile kadanai, &lt;&lt;A Urushelima ɗa n kuzuwa kula kuva̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Ɗa u maꞋakai wotoi n azangata a gaɗi atalialyuka a ulanga u re e wa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Ɗa u lyukai maku ma̱ ni akina. Ɗa u ka̱na̱i kuyaꞋan tsuboci n kapalan ka̱shi. U ka̱na̱i kutono aza a na a gbaɓai kaci n a̱kpisa̱. Ɗa u yaꞋin kagbanigbani ka̱u u Vuzavaguɗu, ka na ka zuwai Vuzavaguɗu wupa n a̱bunda̱i. <verse eid="2KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Ɗa u sheꞋwei kululu ku ka̱ma̱li ka Ashera ɗa u shikpa̱i kuɗa a̱Ꞌisa̱ a̱ Ka̱shile, a̱ ubuta̱ u na Ka̱shile kadanai Dawuda koɓolo n Sulemanu kolobo ka̱ ni, &lt;&lt;Punu a kpaꞋa ku nampa n Urushelima ɗa n zagbai a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci ka aza a Isaraila ra̱ka̱, n kuzuwa kula ku va̱ ayin babu uteku. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Mpa n kudoku kuzuwa ene a aza a Isaraila uta̱ kpamu a iɗika i na n nekei ikaya i le ba, ɗa baci o tonoi wila̱ u va̱, n wila̱ u na kagbashi ka̱ va̱ Musa u nekei le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Ama ɗa uma a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱i kupana, ɗa tana Manasa u variki le, ɗa a yaꞋin kagbanigbani ka na ka laꞋi uduniya u na Vuzavaguɗu wu unai kafu a aza Isaraila.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u yaꞋin kadanshi a̱ ubuta̱ wa agbashi a̱ ni eneki, u danai. <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />&lt;&lt;Adama ili yu unata i nampa, i na Manasa mogono ma a Yahuda u yaꞋin, ɗa kpamu u yaꞋin u nushi u gbayin u na u laꞋi wa aza Amoriya, e le na ishi punu n ida̱shi kafu a̱yi, ɗa kpamu u zuwai aza a Yahuda u nushi a̱ ubuta̱ u kutono ka a̱ma̱li a̱ ni, <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />adama nannai, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila ka dana ta̱. La̱na̱, mi ta̱ a̱ kutuka̱ n atakaci a ili i nampa a Urushelima n Yahuda, ka̱ta̱ yaba dem na u panai u jeꞋeke ikyamba. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Ka̱ta̱, n gisangu Israila n vicuꞋu vu kawin ka na n gisanki Samariya n vicuꞋu vu kawin ka na kpamu n gisanki kpaꞋa ku Ahabu, ka̱ta̱ n teneꞋen Urushelima ra̱ka̱-ra̱ka̱ tsu na vuza u tsu teneꞋen mevene, ka̱ta̱ u kimba̱ maꞋa. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Ka̱ta̱ n vakangu kagimi ka kumaci ku uma a̱ va̱, ka̱ta̱ n neke le ekiye a i rala i le aza a na e ku reme ka̱ta̱ isa le u canuku u kuvon. <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />Adama na a yaꞋan ta̱ kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a̱ va̱, ɗa kpamu a zuwai mu wupa, a kanna ka na ikaya i le yi uta̱i a iɗika i Masar, ali a̱ ku ta̱wa̱ anana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Manasa kpamu wu una ta̱ aza babu unushi n a̱bunda̱i, ali Urushelima u shanai nu mpasa ma aza babu unushi a uteku u nampa a kubana uteku u nan ɗe, babu biꞋi n unushi u na u zuwai aza a Yahuda a yaꞋankai Vuzavaguɗu.<verse eid="2KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Kagimi ku ulinga ka Manasa n ili i na u yaꞋin a ayin tsugono ci ni, koɓolo n unushi u na u yaꞋin dem, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka tsumani tsu ngono ma Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Ɗa Manasa u bankai ukpisa̱ ɗa a ciɗa̱ngi ni a kashina ka kpaꞋa ka̱ ni, kashina ka Uza. Ɗa Amon kolobo ka̱ ni ko okpoi mogono a una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amon mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amon wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kamanga n e re ana u gita̱i tsugono, ɗa u lyai tsugono tsu Urushelima a̱ya̱ e re. Kula ka a̱na̱ku ni ku ɗa Meshulemetu mekere ma Haruza vuza va aza a Jotuba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Ɗa u yaꞋin kagbanigbani u Vuzavaguɗu tsu na esheku a̱ ni Manasa u yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />U tonoi ili na esheku a̱ ni u yaꞋin ra̱ka̱, ɗa u tonoi a̱ma̱li a na esheku a̱ ni u tonoi ɗa u cikpai le. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />U ka̱sukpa̱i Vuzavaguɗu, Ka̱shile ki ikaya i ni, u kpa̱ɗa̱i kutono uye u Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Ɗa nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ mu ulinga n Amon mogono a gbaɓai kaci ke le ɗa unai ni a suvu e kefeku ko tsugono ci ni. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Ama ɗa uma a̱ likuci a unai aza a na a yaꞋin nsata ɗa unai Amon mogono ma, ɗa aza a̱ likuci a, a zuwai Josaya kolobo ka̱ ni tsugono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Amon n ili i na u yaꞋin, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka tsumani tsu ngono n Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngi ni a kasaun ka̱ ni a kashina ka Uza. Ɗa Josaya kolobo ka̱ ni ko okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Josaya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Josaya wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kunla̱i a na u gita̱i tsugono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono tsu Urushelima a̱ya̱ kamangankupa n kete. Kula ka a̱na̱kpa̱ ni ku ɗa Jedida mekere ma Adaya va aza Bozukatu. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Ɗa u yaꞋin kasingai u Vuzavaguɗu, u tonoi uye wa a kaya a̱ ni Dawuda ra̱ka̱, kpamu u kpatala usingai ko ugula̱ ba.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josaya u lapulai a̱Ꞌisa̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupankunla̱i ka tsugono ci ni, ɗa Josaya u suꞋuki Shafan kolobo ka Azaliya matsukaya ma Meshulam a kubana a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. U danai, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />&lt;&lt;Gaɗukpai i bana u Hilikiya ganu vu gbayin, adama a na u kece ikebe i na uma a̱ tuka̱i a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, i na aza kindi u utsutsu isai ekiye a uma. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Ka̱ta̱ a ɗika ikebe ya e neke aza a kulapu ka̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. Ka̱ta̱ e le tamkpamu a ɗika a tsupa aza ulinga a na i a kulapula a̱Ꞌisa̱, <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />n aza a̱ kukpa̱Ꞌa̱, n amaꞋi koɓolo n ashewi atali. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu a̱ ciya̱ i na a ku tsulaka aburakpatsu n atali a na kulapulaka a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Kpamu vuza wi a kece le o tono uteku tsu na unai ikebe ya ba, adama a na i ta̱ a kuyaꞋan ulinga u le n kamayun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hilikiya u ciya̱i Katagarda ka̱ Wila̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Ɗa Hilikiya ganu vu gbayin u danai Shafan kaɗani ko mogono, &lt;&lt;N ciya̱ ta̱ katagarda ka wila̱ punu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt;Ɗa u nekei Shafan ɗa u keci ka. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Ɗa Shafan kaɗani, u banai o mogono, ɗa u danai ni. &lt;&lt;Kagbashi ka̱ nu ka pura̱ ta̱ ikebe i na a̱ ciya̱i a̱Ꞌisa̱ ɗa e nekei aza kelime na i ulinga a̱Ꞌisa̱ Vuzavaguɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Ɗa Shafan u danai mogono, &lt;&lt;Ganu Hilikiya u neke mu ta̱ katagarda.&gt;&gt; Ɗa Shafan u keci ka e kelime ko mogono.<verse eid="2KI 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Ana mogono ma panai kadanshi ka katagarda ka wila̱ ka, ɗa u karai ntogu n ni. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Ɗa mogono ma danai Hilikiya ganu, n Ahikam kolobo ka Shafan, n Akubo kolobo ka Mikaya, n Shafan kaɗani ko mogono koɓolo n Asaya kalingata ka mogono. U danai, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />&lt;&lt;Banai i la̱nsa̱ kuyeve ku Vuzavaguɗu adama katagarda kana a̱ ciya̱i na va, i yaꞋan keci adama a̱ va̱, n adama uma koɓolo n aza Yahuda dem. Adama a na mayun, wupa u Vuzavaguɗu u yimkpa ta̱ n ka̱bunda̱i wa̱ tsu, adama a na ikaya i tsu i tono wila̱ u na katagarda kanampa ko o tonoi ba, kpamu a yaꞋan i na yi uɗani a katagarda kanampa adama a̱ tsu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Ɗa ganu Hilikiya koɓolo n Ahikam, n Akubo, n Shafan, n Asaya a banai u Huluda vuka vu Shalum keneki, kolobo ka Tikuwa, matsukaya ma Haruhasu, ka̱la̱ni ko ntogu n ganu, gogo na wi ta̱ n ida̱shi punu a Urushelima, uɓon u i re. Ɗa a yaꞋin kadanshi n a̱yi.<verse eid="2KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Ɗa u danai le,&lt;&lt;Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila ka dana ta̱. &lt;Danai vuza na u suki ɗa̱ wa̱va̱ va, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />Vuzavaguɗu u dana ta̱. La̱na̱, n ku tuka̱ ta̱ n kawuya ubuta̱ u nampa, n ubuta̱ wa aza ana i punu. Tsu na kadanshi ka ki a katagarda kana mogono ma Yahuda ma kecei. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Adama a na aza a Yahuda a̱ ka̱sukpa̱ mu ta̱, ɗa a̱ ka̱na̱i ku yaꞋanka a̱ma̱li o yoku kuneꞋe ki ili i ma̱gula̱ni, adama a na a zuwa mu wupa n ulinga wa ekiye u le ra̱ka̱, adama a nannai wupa u va̱ wi ta̱ a kutasa adama ubuta̱ u nampa, kpamu babu vuza na wa ku kima̱ u ɗa.&gt; <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Ama adama a na mogono ma Yahuda, a̱yi ɗa u suki ɗa̱ i bana i la̱nsa̱ kuyeve ku Vuzavaguɗu, &lt;I na ya kudana yi i ɗanna, Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ki Isaraila ka dana ta̱, adama ukuna u kadanshi ka na vu panai, <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />adama a na vi ta̱ n ka̱ɗu ko kutoni, kpamu ɗa vu goyoi ka̱ci ka̱ nu e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu, an vu panai uteku tsu na n dansai adama a̱ ubuta̱ u nampa koɓolo n uma a na i punu, a na o kokpo agali ka̱ta̱ n yaꞋanka le una̱, ɗa vu karai ntogu n nu ali ɗa vu shika̱i a ma̱ka̱nga̱ ma̱ va̱, mpa feu m pana ta̱, mpa Vuzavaguɗu n dansai. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Adama a nannai, n kuzuwa wu ta̱ vu kuwa̱, vu tono ikaya i nu, ka̱ta̱ a ciɗa̱ngu wu a kasaun ka̱ nu n ma̱ta̱na̱. Ka̱ta̱ a̱shi a̱ nu a̱ kpa̱ɗa̱ kene kawuya ka na n kutuka̱ a̱ ubuta̱ u nampa.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Ɗa a banai a danai mogono ra̱ka̱ ili i na vuka va vu danai.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s1">Josaya u lapulasakai Uzuwakpani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Ɗa mogono me ɗekei aza a̱ gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ a Yahuda n Urushelima ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Ɗa u lazai a kubana a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu koɓolo n aza a Yahuda, n aza a Urushelima, n anan ganu, n eneki koɓolo n uma ra̱ka̱, maku n vuzagbayin. Ɗa u kecekei le katagarda ka̱ wila̱ ka na u ciya̱i a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu a. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Ɗa mogono ma̱ ɗa̱nga̱i kashani ɗevu n kashamkpatsu, ɗa u yaꞋin Uzuwakpani e kelime ka Vuzavaguɗu. U danai, yu ushuku ta̱ an wa kutono Vuzavaguɗu n wila̱ u ni, n kadanshi ka̱ ni n ili i kutono, n ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni koɓolo n wuma u ni ra̱ka̱, ka̱ta̱ kpamu u tono kadanshi ku uzuwakpani ka na ki punu uɗani a katagarda ka nampa. Ɗa uma ra̱ka̱ ushuki n wila̱ wa feu.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Ɗa mogono ma zuwai Hilikiya vuzagbayin vu anan ganu, n anan ganu na a na i o kutono yi, koɓolo n aza a kindi a̱ utsutsu a bana a̱ utuka̱ n ebelu a na a tsu yaꞋanka kutoni ku ka̱ma̱li ka Balu, n Ashera, n wotoi n azangata. Ɗa ma zuwai o songi i ɗa a̱ uka̱ra̱Ꞌi u Urushelima ɗevu n ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Kidiron, ɗa u pura̱i kokomo ka ɗa u bankai e Betelu. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Ɗa u cipa̱ka̱i anan ganu a̱ma̱li a na ngono n Yahuda n zuwai adama a na a yaꞋansa alyuka o kusongu a̱ ubuta̱ wu nva̱li a̱ likuci i Yahuda ra̱ka̱ n uka̱ra̱Ꞌi u Urushelima. Koɓolo n aza a na o tsu songu ili i ma̱gula̱ni u ka̱ma̱li ka Balu, n kanna, n wotoi, n azangata koɓolo n ili i na yi gaɗi tsugbashi. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Ɗa Josaya wu utuka̱i iyoci i ka̱ma̱li ka Ashera punu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu u bankai pulai vu likuci i Urushelima. Ɗa u bankai kaꞋa o ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Kidiron. Ɗa u songi ɗe kaꞋa, ɗa u wu iruwai kaꞋa ko okpoi kiya ɗa u bula̱ngi kaꞋa asaun aza a unambi. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Ɗa u zuwai o ɓosoi anunu ashakanlai a̱ ma̱ci n ali a na i punu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu a̱ ubuta̱ u na a̱ma̱ci a tsu yaꞋan kucaꞋa adama ka̱ma̱li ka Ashera.<verse eid="2KI 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Ɗa Josaya wu utuka̱i anan ganu ra̱ka̱ a na i punu a̱ likuci i Yahuda. Ɗa u la̱nga̱sa̱i nva̱li n le, ubuta̱ u na anan ganu e tsu neke alyuka o kusongu e le. U yaꞋan ta̱ nannai a̱ likuci i Geba vu uɓon u ɗaka n Yahuda, ali a kubana Biyasheba n uɓon ugaɗi u Yahuda. U la̱nga̱sa̱i nva̱li n na mi utsutsu u likuci ya, ili i na i ɗikai a utsutsu wa, a kubana utsutsu u Joshuwa, likuci i gomuna i na yi n uɓon u ɗaka wu utsutsu wa. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Dem n nannai anan ganu a ubuta̱ u kucikpa ka a bana a katalikalyuka ka Vuzavaguɗu a Urushelima ba, ama a lyaꞋi boroji vu babu yisiti koɓolo n itoku e le anan ganu.<verse eid="2KI 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Ɗa wila̱kpa̱i Tofetu vuna wi a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Hinomu, tsu na babu vuza vu na wa kudoku we neke kolobo ko mekere ma̱ ni tsa alyuka u Moleki ba. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Ɗa u takpai odoku a na ngono ma Yahuda n nekei adama a na a yaꞋanka kanna tsugbashi. Odoku n nampa i ta̱ punu a ulanga wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱, ɗevu n kunu ku Natan-meleki, kabara ko mogono. Ɗa Josaya u songi ekeke odoku a na e nekei kuyaꞋanka kanna tsugbashi.<verse eid="2KI 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />U muɗa̱i kpamu atalialyuka a na ngono n Yahuda m maꞋin gaɗi vu kukpa̱Ꞌa̱ ɗevu n kunu ku gaɗi ku Ahazu, koɓolo n atalialyuka a na Manasa u maꞋin a ulanga u re wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. U muɗa̱i le, ɗa u ɓosoi le miri-miri u va̱ma̱i a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Kidiron. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Ɗa kpamu mogono ma̱ ila̱kpa̱i nva̱li ma̱ a̱ma̱li n na Sulemanu mogono u maꞋin a kasana ka Urushelima a kubana a uɓon u ɗaka a kaginda kagbayin ka munuka. Sulemanu u maꞋin ubuta̱ u nampa adama kululu ku ka̱ma̱li ku unata ka Ashera ka aza a Sidon, n Kemoshi Kululu ku unata ka aza a Mowabu koɓolo n Moleki kululu ku unata ka aza a Amon. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Ɗa u ɓosoi atali a ciɗa e le, ɗa kpamu u kapai nlulu ma ashamkpatsu a̱ma̱li n Ashera, ɗa u ciɗa̱ngi ubuta̱ wa n etele uma.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Ɗa kpamu u doku u zuwai o ɓoso katalikalyuka ka na ki e Betelu, a̱ ubuta̱ wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ wu unata u na mogono Jerobuwam kolobo ka Nebatu ka maꞋin, ka na ka zuwai aza a Isaraila kuyaꞋan unushi, o songi u ɗa, ɗa wu iruwai kaꞋa u bonokoi kaꞋa kiya. Ɗa kpamu u songi kululu ku ka̱ma̱li ku Ashera. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Ana Josaya u kpatalai ɗa we enei asaun o yoku a kaginda. Ɗa u zuwai a bana a̱ ciɗukpa̱ etele e le, ɗa u songi a ɗa gaɗi vu katalikalyuka, ɗa wila̱kpa̱i ka a. Tsu na kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka na ka̱ uta̱i una̱ u keneki.<verse eid="2KI 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Ɗa mogono me ecei, &lt;&lt;Kasaun kene ka tamkpamu mi e kene naɗe?&gt;&gt; Ɗa aza a̱ likuci a, a danai, &lt;&lt;Kasaun ka vuma vu Ka̱shile kaꞋa, vuza na wu uta̱i a Yahuda ɗa u yaꞋin kadanshi adama ili i na vu yaꞋin n katalikalyuka ka Betelu ka nampa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Ɗa u danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱sukpa̱i kaꞋa, Ka̱ta̱ vuza u ɗika etele a̱ ni ba.&gt;&gt;Ɗa a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i etele ni koɓolo n etele e eneki a na uta̱i a Samariya.<verse eid="2KI 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Tsu na u yaꞋin a̱ likuci Betelu, ta mogono Josaya u takpai ɗa wila̱kpa̱i nva̱li ma̱ a̱ma̱li n na mi a̱ likuci i Samariya ra̱ka̱, n na mogono mi Isaraila ma maꞋin ɗa n zuwai Vuzavaguɗu wupa. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Ɗa u lyukai anan ganu vu nva̱li ma̱ a̱ma̱li n na mi a katalikalyuka ka ra̱ka̱, ɗa u songi etele a uma a gaɗi vu le. Yeve ɗa u lazai o kubono a Urushelima.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Ɗa mogono ma danai uma dem, &lt;&lt;A yaꞋansa ka̱ɗiva̱ ka kupasamgbanai ka Vuzavaguɗu Ka̱shile ka̱ ɗa̱, uteku tsu na ka ki uɗani a katagarda ku uzuwukpani ka nampa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Adama a na o doku a yaꞋan ka̱ɗiva̱ ka kupasamgbanai tsu nanlo ba, ali a ayin azafada aza a na o tonoi n aza a Isaraila. Ko a ayin o ngono mi Isaraila m ma aza a Yahuda ba. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Ama a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n kula̱i ko tsugono tsu Josaya ɗa a yaꞋin ka̱ɗiva̱ ka kupasamgbanai ka Vuzavaguɗu ka nampa a Urushelima.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Ɗa Josaya kpamu u lokoi oboci n aza a̱da̱bu, n a̱kpisa̱, nu nlulu ma̱ a̱ma̱li koɓolo n ili yi unata dem i na i e kene a Urushelima n Yahuda. U yaꞋin ili nampa nannai adama a na u shatangu ku yotsongu kadanshi ka̱ wila̱ ka na ki a katagarda ka na ganu Hilikiya u ciya̱i a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Ko kelime ka̱ ni ko ka̱ca̱pa̱ ka̱ ni, a saꞋwa kuciya̱ mogono ma na mo tonoi Ka̱shile n ka̱ɗu ka̱ ni, n wuma u ni n utsura u ni dem, tsu mogono Josaya ba, tsu na wila̱ u Musa u tonoi ba.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Ama nannai dem Vuzavaguɗu u ka̱sukpa̱ wupa wa̱ a̱bunda̱i u ni n Yahuda ba, adama ili i na Manasa u yaꞋansai ra̱ka̱, i na i zuwai Ka̱shile wupa. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u danai, &lt;&lt;Mayun, n kutakpa ta̱ Yahuda e kelime ka̱va̱, uteku tsu na n takpai aza a Isaraila. Ka̱ta̱ kpamu n takpa a̱shi a̱va̱ a Urushelima likuci i na n zagbai, n a̱Ꞌisa̱ a nanlo a na n zagbai n danai, &lt;Ta ɗe kula kuva̱ ko kuyongo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukpa̱ u mogono Josaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Josaya n ili i na u yaꞋansai ra̱ka̱, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ka tsumani tsu ngono ma Yahuda.<verse eid="2KI 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />A ayin na Josaya wi o tsugono, FiriꞋauna Neko mogono ma Masar ma banai e kuyene ku Yufiretu, adama na u ɓa̱nka̱ mogono ma Asiriya kuvon. Ɗa Josaya wu uta̱i adama a na u sa̱nka̱ FiriꞋauna Neko kulaza a kubana a Magido, ɗa tana FiriꞋauna wu unai ni lo a̱ ubuta̱ wa. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Ɗa agbashi o mogono Josaya a̱ ni a ɗikai ni ekeke vo odoku, ɗa a̱ tuka̱i ni a Urushelima, ɗa a̱ ciɗa̱ngi ni a kasaun ka̱ ni. Ɗa aza a̱ likuci a, a ɗikai kolobo ka ni Jehowahazu a zuwai ni wo okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehowahazu mogono ma a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Jehowahazu wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kamanganatatsu a na wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyai tsugono a Urushelima wotoi u tatsu. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku ka̱ ni ku ɗa Hamutalu, mekere ma Irimiya vuza va aza a Libina. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Mogono Jehowahazu u yaꞋanka ta̱ Vuzavaguɗu kagbanigbani uteku tsu na ikaya i ni i yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Ɗa FiriꞋauna Neko mogono ma Masar ma reme ni ɗa u gbagurai ni a̱ likuci i Ribula a iɗika i Hamata, adama a na ka̱ta̱ u lyaꞋa tsugono a Urushelima ba. Ɗa FiriꞋauna Neko kpamu u zuwai aza a Yahuda a tsupa utafu wa azurufa a̱kpa̱n a tatsu n amangatawa̱na̱shi, (3,400) n azanariya kamangankupa n a̱na̱shi. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Ɗa FiriꞋauna Neko mogono ma Masar u zuwai Eliyakimu kolobo ka Josaya tsugono a̱ una̱ wu esheku a̱ ni. Ɗa u yaꞋansakai ni kula u ɗekei ni Jehoyakimu. Ama ɗa u ɗikai Jehowahazu u bankai a Masar, ɗa u kuwa̱i ɗe. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Ɗa Jehoyakimu u tsupai FiriꞋauna Neko azurufa n azanariya a na we ecei ni u tsupa. Ama ɗa u zuwai uma a tsupa utafu adama a na u ciya̱ ikebe i na FiriꞋauna u la̱nsa̱i. Ɗa u takacikai uma wuya-wuya uteku wu utsura u le, adama a na e neke yi azurufa n azanariya ciya̱ u shatangu uzuwakpani u ni n FiriꞋauna Neko mogono ma Masar.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoyakimu mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Jehoyakimu wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kamanga n a tawun a na wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyaꞋi tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ kupa n kete. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni kuɗa Zebida mekere ma Pedaya vuza va aza a Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Ɗa u yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu, tsu na ikaya i ni i yaꞋin.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />A ayin o tsugono tsu Jehoyakimu, ɗa Nebukaneza mogono ma Babila ma bankai Yahuda kuvon. Mogono Jehoyakimu u yaꞋan ta̱ a̱ya̱ a tatsu a̱ ku ga̱nda̱ka̱ mogono ma Babila. N ka̱ca̱pa̱ ɗa Jehoyakimu u bonoi a kuyaꞋanka Nebukaneza ugbamiwasuvu. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Ɗa Vuzavaguɗu u suki ka̱tsura̱ ko osoji ka aza a Babila, n aza a Siriya, n aza a Mowabu koɓolo n aza Amon adama a na a una aza a Yahuda, ciya̱ a shatangu kadanshi ka Vuzavaguɗu ka na eneki a dansai. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Mayun i nampa ya i ciya̱ ta̱ Yahuda tsu na Vuzavaguɗu u dansai, ciya̱ u loko le wa̱ ni, adama a unushi u Manasa n ili i na u yaꞋain dem, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />koɓolo nu mpasa ma aza a babu unushi n na u tsuwa̱in punu a Urushelima. U shatangi Urushelima nu mpasa ma aza babu unushi. Vuzavaguɗu tana u sheshe cinukpaka yi unushi wa ba.<verse eid="2KI 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Ulinga u na u buwai u tsugono tsu Jehoyakimu n ili i na u yaꞋain ra̱ka̱, yi ta̱ uɗani a katagarda ko ngono ma Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Ɗa Jehoyakimu u bankai ukpisa̱. Ɗa Jehoyakini kolobo ka̱ ni ko okpoi mogono a̱ una̱ u ni.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Ama mogono ma Masar mo doku ma̱ uta̱ kubana kuvon kpamu ba, adama a na mogono ma Babila ma isa ta̱ uteku wu iɗika i ni ra̱ka̱, ali ɗe a̱ ka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱ ka Masar a kubana e kuyene ku Yufiretu.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoyakini mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Jehoyakini wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kupa n kunla̱i a na wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyai tsugono a Urushelima wotoi u tatsu. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa Nehushata, mekere ma Elinatan vuza va aza a Urushelima. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Ɗa u yaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu tsu na esheku a̱ ni u yaꞋin.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />A ayin nanlo ɗa ovonshi o mogono Nebukaneza vu Babila a bankai Urushelima kuvon, a na a yawai ɗa a kanzai likuci ya, <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />ɗa Nebukaneza mogono ma Babila ma uwai a̱ likuci ya, a ayin a na ovonshi a̱ ni a kanzai likuci ya n kuvon. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Ɗa mogono Jehoyakini mogono ma Yahuda, n a̱na̱ku a̱ ni, n aza ulinga a̱ ni, n tsugbayin tsu likuci koɓolo n anan taji a̱ ni, ra̱ka̱ vu le e nekei mogono ma Babila utan. Ama ɗa a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ kunla̱i ko tsugono ci ni, ɗa u bankai Jehoyakini ugbashi. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Tsu na Vuzavaguɗu u dansai, ɗa Nebukaneza u pura̱i kuzuwa ka̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu n ku na ki e kefeku ko mogono ra̱ka̱, ɗa kpamu u ɗikai ucanuku wa azanariya u na mogono Sulemanu mi Isaraila u yaꞋin adama a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Ɗa u pura̱i aza a Urushelima, aza a gbagbaꞋin a̱ likuci, n ovonshi, n aza ulinga wu ekiye, n awakana ra̱ka̱ u bankai ugbashi. Ka̱bunda̱i ka uma ka ele ɗa uma a̱kpa̱n kupa (10,000). Babu vuza na u buwai, sai vuza na u laꞋi n unambi. <verse eid="2KI 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Ɗa kpamu u ɗikai Jehoyakini u bankai ni ugbashi a Babila, koɓolo n a̱na̱ku a̱ ni, n a̱ma̱ci a̱ ni, nu nkoshi m gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n ni koɓolo n aza e kelime ka̱ likuci ya ra̱ka̱. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Ɗa mogono Nebukaneza u pura̱i ovonshi utsura aza a na a fuɗai kuvon u bankai ugbashi a Babila, ka̱bunda̱i ke le ka yawa ta̱ a̱kpa̱n e cindere (7,000). Koɓolo n aza ulinga we ekiye, n awakana ka̱kpa̱n (1,000), ra̱ka̱ vu le uma utsura a ɗa n aza a na untsai kuvon. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Ɗa mogono Nebukaneza u zuwai Mataniya, esheku e keꞋen a Jehoyakini u lyaꞋa tsugono a̱ una̱ u ni. Ɗa u sabai ni kula Zedekiya.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zedekiya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Zedekiya wi ta̱ n a̱ya̱ kamanga n kete a na wo okpoi mogono, ɗa u lyai tsugono a Urushelima a̱ya̱ kupa n kete. Kula ka̱ a̱na̱ku a̱ ni ku ɗa Hamutalu mekere ma Irimiya vuza va aza a Libina. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Ɗa uyaꞋin kagbanigbani a̱ a̱shi a Vuzavaguɗu tsu na Jehoyakimu u yaꞋin. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />Ili i nampa i yaꞋan ta̱ adama a wupa u Vuzavaguɗu a kubana a Urushelima n Yahuda, ɗa a ukocishi u lokoi le a̱ a̱shi a̱ ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 24:20">Ɗa Zedekaya u yaꞋankai mogono ma Babila ugbamiwasuvu.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Ele lo a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka̱ kuci ko tsugono tsu Zedekiya, a kanna ka kupa ko wotoi u kupa, ɗa Nebukaneza mogono ma Babila u banai kuvon a Urushelima n ovonshi a̱ ni ra̱ka̱. Ɗa a kambuki likuci ya, a maꞋi adasukpatsu a̱ ka̱ra̱ka̱i mashilya ma. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Ɗa a kanzai likuci ya n kuvon ali a̱ya̱ kupa n kete ko tsugono tsu Zedekaya. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />A kanna ka kuci ko wotoi u na̱shi, a na kambulu ke geꞋwetengi uma, kpamu ilikulyaꞋa i ɗana yi lo ba, a na uma a lyaꞋa. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Ɗa a banai o ɓosoi kakambu koyoku ka mashilya ka, ɗa ovonshi ra̱ka̱ a sumai n kayin n ubuta̱ u katusu ka mashilya ka, ka na ki ɗevu n kashina ko mogono. Ama a ayin a nanlo cina ɗe ovonshi a Babila a kanza likuci ya, ɗa mogono Zedekaya n ovonshi a̱ ni a sumai a kubana a uɓon u Araba. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Ama ɗa ovonshi a Babila a saɓai mogono Zedekaya ɗa e remei ni akamba e Jeriko. Ɗa ovonshi a̱ ni ra̱ka̱ a sumai a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i ni. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Ɗa e remei ni, a bankai ni u mogono ma Babila a̱ likuci i Ribula, a̱ ubuta̱ u na a kiɗikai ni afada. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Ɗa a unai muku n Zedekaya a̱ a̱shi a̱ ni. Ɗa o kongoroi ni a̱shi ɗa a shiya ni n ikani a lazai n a̱yi a kubana a Babila.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyikpi wa̱ A̱Ꞌisa̱ a Gbayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />A kanna ke cindere ko wotoi u tawun, a ka̱ya̱ ka kupa n kuci ko tsugono tsu Nebukaneza mogono ma Babila, ɗa Nebuzaradan vuza kelime va aza a kindi ku mogono ma Babila u ta̱wa̱i a Urushelima. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Ɗa u dyaɓai akina a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu, n kpaꞋa ku mogono koɓolo n iꞋuwa ya aza a gbagbaꞋin a Urushelima. Ɗa u songi iꞋuwa i singai i singai dem a̱ likuci ya. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Ɗa ovonshi a Babila ra̱ka̱, e le na i koɓolo n Nebuzaradan o ɓosoi mashilya ma na ma ka̱ra̱Ꞌi Urushelima. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Ɗa Nebuzaradan vuza vu kelime va aza a kindi ku mogono u remei uma a na a buwai punu a̱ likuci i Urushelima, n ovonshi a na e nekei ka̱ci ka̱ le wa̱ ni koɓolo n uma a na a buwai ra̱ka̱ vu le ɗa u bankai le ugbashi a Babila. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Ama ɗa a̱ ka̱sukpa̱i aza unambi o yoku adama na a cimba ashina a itacishi.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Ɗa osoji a Babila o ɓosoi ashamkpatsu a iyum i shili, n ekeke odoku a iyum i shili i na i remei mini, n kasasu ka viyum vi shili kagbayin ka na ki punu a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. Ɗa ovonshi a̱ pura̱i iyum i shili ya ra̱ka̱ a kubana a Babila. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Ɗa kpamu a̱ pura̱i mgbodo mi iyum, n ikenekpetsu, n ikima̱tsu ya akina, n ebelyu koɓolo n ucanuku wu iyum ishili ra̱ka̱ una a tsu yaꞋanka ulinga wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Ɗa vuza kelime va aza a kindi va, u ɗikai ka̱mbu ka akina, n kasasu ka ku ɗarukpa, n ili ra̱ka̱ i na a yaꞋin n azanariya n azurufa koci.<verse eid="2KI 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Ashamkpatsu e re a iyum ishili a, n kasasu kagbayin ka na ka̱ tsu ɓa̱na̱ mini ka na Sulemanu u yaꞋin adama a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu a, a laꞋa ta̱ ka̱bunda̱i ka kugisangu. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Kashamkpatsu dem ugaɗi u ni u yawa ta̱ udashi kamanga n u cindere. A gaɗi Vu kashamkpatsu ka̱ viyum vu shili va u yawa ta̱ udashi u na̱shi n kagimi, ɗa a yaꞋin igani a kashamkpatsu dem n umaci u Ruman n iyum ishili a̱ kuka̱ra̱Ꞌa̱.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Ɗa vuza kelime va aza a kindi va u ɗikai Seraya ganu vu gbayin, n Zafaniya vuza na wi o kutono yi, koɓolo n aza a kindi a tatsu a na a tsu inda utsutsu wa̱ a̱Ꞌisa̱ a Vuzavaguɗu. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />A ka̱tsuma̱ ka aza na ishi a buwai a̱ likuci tamkpamu, ɗa u ɗikai kovonshi vo osoji koɓolo n nkoshi n gba̱ra̱-gba̱ra̱ n tawun n kefeku ko tsugono. Ɗa kpamu u ɗikai kaɗani kagbayin ko ovonshi ka̱ likuci ka, vuza na u ci ɗika uma ulinga u tsusoji koɓolo n uma a̱ ni amangatatsu a na u cinai punu a̱ likuci ya. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Ɗa Nebuzaradan u pura̱i uma nampa ra̱ka̱ u bankai mogono ma Babila a̱ likuci i Ribula. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Ɗe a Ribula va, a iɗika i Hamatu ya, ɗa mogono ma zuwai una le. Nannai ɗa a̱ pura̱i uma a Yahuda a bankai le ugbashi.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Ɗa Nebukaneza mogono ma aza a Babila u zagbai Gedaliya kolobo ka Ahikam matsukaya ma Shafan wo okpo gomuna vu uma a na a buwai a Yahuda. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Ana aza e kelime osoji n uma ra̱ka̱ a panai mogono ma Babila ma zagba ta̱ Gedaliya wo okpo gomuna, ɗa a bankai n uma e le wa̱ a̱ni a Mizifa, ula e le ɗa IshimaꞋilu kolobo ka Netaniya, n Johanan kolobo ka Kareya, n Seraya kolobo ka Tanhumetu vuza va aza a Netofa, n Jazaniya kolobo ka vuza va za Makatu. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Ɗa Gedaliya u kucinakai le n uma e le. U danai, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ta̱ i pana wovon u tsugbayin tsa aza a Babila ba, La̱nsa̱i ubuta̱ i da̱sa̱ngu punu i ɗika ya, i yaꞋanka mogono ma Babila a̱ga̱nda̱ yi ta̱ a̱ kuciya̱ ma̱ta̱na̱ mi ida̱shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2KI 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Ama o wotoi u cindere u ka̱ya̱ wa, ɗa IshimaꞋilu kolobo ka Netaniya ma tsukaya ma Ilishama vuza te a̱ ka̱tsuma̱ ka kumaci ku mogono ka, u ta̱wa̱i n uma kupa ɗa unai Gedaliya. Ɗa kpamu unai uma a Yahuda koɓolo n aza Babila ana i koɓolo n Gedaliya a Mizipa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />N tsu nampa, ɗa uma ra̱ka̱, maku n vuza gbanyin koɓolo n aza e kelime osoji ra̱ka̱ a sumai a kubana a iɗika i Masar, adama na i ta̱ a kupana wovon wa aza a Babila.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utuka̱i Jehoyakini a kpaꞋa ku ugbashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />A̱ ka̱ya̱ ka kamangankupa n ke cindere, ka tsugbashi tsu Jehoyakini mogono ma Yahuda, a̱ ka̱ya̱ ka na Evili-merodaki wo okpoi mogono ma Babila, ka ɗaɗa a̱ utuka̱i Jehoyakini a kpaꞋa ku ugbashi, a kanna ka kamanga n ka cindere ko wotoi kupa n ure. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Ɗa mogono Evili-merodaki u nekei ni kadanshi ka singai, ɗa kpamu u neke ni tsugbayin tsu na tsu laꞋi tsu ngono n na mi ekiye ni a Babila dem. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Ɗa Jehoyakini u foɗoi ntogu n tsugbashi n ni. Ili i na i ɗikai a kanna ka nanlo ɗa u ka̱na̱i kulyaꞋa ilikulya a kirukpa ku mogono ali ukocishi u wuma u ni. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Ɗa mogono Evili-merodaki u zuwai a̱ ka̱na̱i kunekeshe mogono Jehoyakini ikebe i katsupu a kanna dem, ali a kubana u koci u wuma u ni.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>